er.EmailAlreadyRegistred\":\"Email address is already registered.\",\"Controllers.Register.WrongEmailFormat\":\"The entered email address is in the wrong format. Please use example@example.com.\",\"Controllers.Register.WrongPasswordFormat\":\"The password should be at least 10 characters long, should contain a lowercase letter, an uppercase letter and at least one number.\",\"Controllers.Register.PasswordLeakedMessage\":\"This password was compromised in a data breach elsewhere on the internet. Please use a different password. <a href=\\\"{0}\\\" class=\\\"error\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Read more</a>\",\"Controllers.Register.EmailAlreadyRegistredLogIn\":\"This email is already registered. Please log in.\",\"Views.Login.TotpEnterPassword.2FA6DigitCode\":\"6-digit code\",\"Views.Login.TotpEnterPassword.2FARequired\":\"Two-Factor Authentication required\",\"Views.Login.TotpEnterPassword.2FARequiredText\":\"You've asked us to require a second authentication factor. Please enter the 6-digit code from your authentication app.\",\"Views.Login.TotpEnterPassword.AuthenticationAnotherWay\":\"Need another way to authenticate?\",\"Views.Login.TotpEnterPassword.ContinueButton\":\"Continue\",\"Views.Login.TotpEnterPassword.RememberDevice\":\"Remember this device for 30 days\",\"Views.Login.TotpAuthenticationAnotherWay.Title\":\"Choose a different authentication method\",\"Views.Login.TotpAuthenticationAnotherWay.RecoveryCodes.Title\":\"Use one of your 8-digit recovery codes\",\"Views.Login.TotpAuthenticationAnotherWay.RecoveryCodes.Text\":\"Those codes were automatically generated for you when you enabled Two-Factor Authentication. We asked you to save them carefully earlier.\",\"Views.Login.TotpAuthenticationAnotherWay.RecoveryEmail.Title\":\"Use a recovery email address\",\"Views.Login.TotpAuthenticationAnotherWay.RecoveryEmail.Text\":\"If you have a recovery email address associated with your account, you can use it to authenticate. If you didn't add this recovery method when setting up your account, use a different authentication method.\",\"Views.Login.TotpAuthenticationAnotherWay.ContinueButton\":\"Continue\",\"Views.Login.TotpAuthenticationAnotherWay.BackButton\":\"Back\",\"Views.Login.TotpAuthenticationAnotherWay.NeedHelp\":\"Need help? Learn more\",\"Views.Login.TotpRecoveryCode.2FA8DigitCode\":\"8-digit code\",\"Views.Login.TotpRecoveryCode.2FARecoveryCodesText\":\"To recover your account, enter one of your 8-digit recovery codes. Recovery codes are one-time codes you can use to log in to your account when you don't have access to your authentication app. Each code can be used only once.\",\"Views.Login.TotpRecoveryCode.2FARecoveryCodesTitle\":\"Recovery codes\",\"Views.Login.TotpRecoveryCode.Back\":\"Back\",\"Views.Login.TotpRecoveryCode.Continue\":\"Continue\",\"Views.Login.TotpRecoveryEmail.2FARecoveryEmailTitle\":\"Recovery email address\",\"Views.Login.TotpRecoveryEmail.2FARecoveryEmailText\":\"To recover your ESET HOME account, we'll send you 2 unique codes. One will be sent to your account email address {{accountEmail}} and the other one to your recovery email address {{recoveryEmail}}.\",\"Views.Login.TotpRecoveryEmail.2FARecoveryEmailSendCodesText\":\"To verify your identity, click \\\"Send codes\\\" and enter the received codes from both your email addresses into the appropriate fields.\",\"Views.Login.TotpRecoveryEmail.SendCodesButton\":\"Send codes\",\"Views.Login.TotpRecoveryEmail.BackButton\":\"Back\",\"Views.Login.TotpRecoveryEmail.EnterRecoveryCodesTitle\":\"Recovery email address\",\"Views.Login.TotpRecoveryEmail.EnterRecoveryCodesText\":\"Enter the authentication codes from both your email addresses into the appropriate fields.\",\"Views.Login.TotpRecoveryEmail.EnterRecoveryCodesInputLabel\":\"Enter the code sent to {{email}}\",\"Views.Login.TotpRecoveryEmail.EnterRecoveryCodesInputError\":\"At least one of the entered codes is incorrect or expired. Please try again. You can resend the codes if necessary.\",\"Views.Login.TotpRecoveryEmail.EnterRecoveryCodesSubmitBtn\":\"Submit\",\"Views.Login.TotpRecoveryEmail.EnterRecoveryCodesResendBtn\":\"Resend codes\",\"Views.Login.TotpRecoveryEmail.EnterRecoveryCodesBackBtn\":\"Back\",\"Views.Shared._Layout.Language\":\"Language\",\"InvalidToken\":\"Invalid link!\",\"TokenUsed\":\"Link has been already used!\",\"TokenExpired\":\"Link has expired.\",\"btnSavePassword2\":\"Confirm change\",\"lcCancel\":\"Cancel\",\"lcConfirmPassword\":\"Confirm new password\",\"lcOr\":\"or\",\"lcPasswordSaved\":\"Password successfully changed.\",\"lcNewPassword\":\"Enter new password\",\"AccountNotFound\":\"Account was either deleted or not found!\",\"btnConfirmSecurityQuestion\":\"Submit\",\"btnDeleteAccount\":\"Confirm delete\",\"lbAbandonAccount\":\"claim the email address and delete the account.\",\"lblErrorSQ\":\"Wrong answer to security question\",\"lcAbandonAccount\":\"Delete Account\",\"lcAbandonInfo\":\"You are about to delete the ESET HOME account assigned to email address {0}. All related data will be lost.\",\"lcSecurityQuestion\":\"Security question:\",\"lcSQHeader\":\"In order to confirm that this is your account, please answer the security question chosen during registration.\",\"AccNotConfirmed\":\"Your email address has not been confirmed yet and therefore your password cannot be reset. Once you confirm your email address, start over at<a href=\\\"{0}\\\"> Forgot password.</a><br/>In case the confirmation email has not arrived, please contact our <a href=\\\"{1}\\\">support team</a>\",\"InvalidLink\":\"Invalid password reset link.\",\"MaxTriesReached\":\"You have reached maximum number of tries ({0}). Please wait {1} minutes.\",\"ResendPassError\":\"Resend password failed\",\"cvPasswordMatch\":\"Passwords do not match.\",\"MaxTriesReachedFirst\":\"You have reached maximum number of tries ({0}). Please wait 30 minutes.\",\"HeaderSQ\":\"Answer Security Question\",\"lcNote\":\"Note: If you did not create this account or you do not remember the answer to your security question, you can \",\"lcNote2\":\"Note: After deleting, you can use this address to create a new ESET HOME account.\",\"AccNotFound2\":\"Account was either deleted or not found!\",\"lcError\":\"Sorry for the inconvenience, there was an error processing your request.\",\"lcMainPageLink\":\"Back to main page...\",\"lcbtnOk\":\"Ok\",\"lcChangePassFailed\":\"Failed to change the password. Please try again later.\",\"PasswordHistoryFailed\":\"Your new password can't be the same as your previous 3 passwords.\",\"InvalidLinkSocial\":\"Invalid link\",\"isPasswordSet\":\"Password successfully set.\",\"Orchestrators.LostPasswordOrchestrator.AccessDenied\":\"Access denied. Too many access attempts.\",\"Orchestrators.LostPasswordOrchestrator.IncorrectEmailAddress\":\"We couldn't find an account that matches the entered email address. Enter a different email address or create an account.\",\"Orchestrators.LostPasswordOrchestrator.WrongEmailFormat\":\"The entered email address is in the wrong format. Please use example@example.com.\",\"Orchestrators.RegisterOrchestrator.SelectOption\":\"-- Select option --\",\"ForgottenPasswordTitle\":\"Forgotten password?\",\"ForgottenPasswordDescription\":\"Enter your account email address, and we will send you an email with instructions for resetting your password.\",\"ForgottenPasswordEmailInputLabel\":\"Email address\",\"ForgottenPasswordEmailNotFound\":\"We couldn't find an account that matches the entered email address. Enter a different email address or create an account.\",\"ForgottenPasswordEmailSentTitle\":\"Check your inbox\",\"ForgottenPasswordEmailSentCheckSpam\":\"Can't find the email? Please check your spam folder.\",\"ForgottenPasswordEmailSentDescription\":\"We've sent an email with the instructions on how to reset your password to the email address you gave us.\",\"GeneralSend\":\"Send\",\"GeneralCancel\":\"Cancel\",\"GeneralGotIt\":\"Got it\",\"GeneralUnexpectedError\":\"An unexpected error has occurred\",\"LoginDontHaveAnAccount\":\"Don't have an account? <0>Create account</0>\",\"LoginLogIn\":\"Log in\",\"LoginTitle\":\"Log in\",\"LoginEmailInputLabel\":\"Email\",\"LoginPasswordInputLabel\":\"Password\",\"LoginForgottenPassword\":\"I forgot my password\",\"LoginOrContinueWith\":\"or continue with\",\"LoginSocialGoogle\":\"Google\",\"LoginSocialApple\":\"Apple\",\"LoginPrivacyPolicy\":\"Privacy policy\",\"LoginCreateAccount\":\"Create account\",\"LoginErrorEmailNotFound\":\"We couldn't find an account that matches the entered email address. Enter a different email address or create an account.\",\"LoginErrorWrongPassword\":\"You entered an incorrect email/password combination.\",\"GeneralLogIn\":\"Log in\",\"GeneralConfirm\":\"Confirm\",\"GeneralDeny\":\"Deny\",\"GeneralSuccess\":\"Success\",\"GeneralResetPassword\":\"Reset password\",\"GeneralCreateAccount\":\"Create account\",\"GeneralLoading\":\"Loading\",\"ResetPassTokenUsedTitle\":\"This link has already been used\",\"ResetPassTokenUsedDesc\":\"We're sorry, but the link to reset your password has already been used. Please click \\\"Reset password\\\" to restart the password reset process.\",\"ResetPassTokenInvalidTitle\":\"This link is invalid\",\"ResetPassTokenInvalidDesc\":\"We're sorry, but the link to reset your password is not valid. Please click \\\"Reset password\\\" to restart the password reset process.\",\"ResetPassAccDeletedTitle\":\"This account was either deleted or not found\",\"ResetPassAccDeletedDesc\":\"We're sorry, but the password you are trying to reset belongs to an account that was either deleted or not found.\",\"ResetPassTokenExpiredTitle\":\"Password reset link expired\",\"ResetPassTokenExpiredDesc\":\"We're sorry, but the link to reset your password has expired. Please click \\\"Reset password\\\" to restart the password reset process.\",\"ResetPassSuccessDesc\":\"Your password was successfully changed.\",\"ResetPassTitle\":\"Enter new password\",\"ResetPassInput\":\"New password\",\"ResetPassPlaceholder\":\"Enter your new password\",\"WrongPasswordFormat\":\"The password should be at least 10 characters long, should contain a lowercase letter, an uppercase letter and at least one number.\",\"PasswordLeakedMessage\":\"This password was compromised in a data breach elsewhere on the internet. Please use a different password. <0>Read more</0>\",\"UpdateYourAppTitle\":\"Update your ESET HOME app\",\"UpdateYourAppText\":\"To continue, update the ESET HOME app to the latest version.\",\"UpdateYourAppBtn\":\"Update now\",\"RegisterTermsAndConditions\":\"By creating an ESET HOME account, you agree to the <0>ESET Terms of Use</0> and confirm you have been informed about our <1>Privacy Policy</1>.\",\"RegisterAlreadyHaveAccount\":\"Already have an account?\",\"RegisterLogIn\":\"Log in\",\"RegisterTitle\":\"Create an account and get started\",\"RegisterIAEmailNotice\":\"We've added the email from your last purchase. Please use it to create your ESET HOME account.\",\"RegisterContinueButtonLabel\":\"Continue with email\",\"RegisterCreateAccountButtonLabel\":\"Create account and log in\",\"RegisterEmailSetLabel\":\"Email:\",\"RegisterEmailInputLabel\":\"Email\",\"RegisterPasswordInputLabel\":\"Password\",\"RegisterPasswordInputPlaceholder\":\"Create your account password\",\"RegisterCountryInputLabel\":\"Country\",\"RegisterReceiveNewsCheckbox\":\"I would like to receive special offers, useful support and product information via electronic channels in compliance with the <0>Privacy Policy</0>.\",\"RegisterErrorEmailAlreadyExists\":\"This email address is already registered.\",\"RegisterErrorInvalidPassword\":\"The password should be at least 10 characters long, should contain a lowercase letter, an uppercase letter and at least one number.\",\"RegisterErrorPasswordLeaked\":\"This password was compromised in a data breach elsewhere on the internet. Please use a different password. <0>Read more</0>\",\"GeneralReadMore\":\"Read more\",\"VerifyTOTPInvalid\":\"The entered code is incorrect. Please try again.\",\"VerifyRecoveryCodeInvalid\":\"The entered code is incorrect. Please try again.\",\"Totp6DigitCode\":\"6-digit code\",\"Totp2FARequired\":\"Two-Factor Authentication required\",\"Totp2FARequiredText\":\"You've asked us to require a second authentication factor. Please enter the 6-digit code from your authentication app.\",\"TotpAuthenticationAnotherWay\":\"Need another way to authenticate?\",\"TotpContinueButton\":\"Continue\",\"TotpRememberDevice\":\"Remember this device for 30 days\",\"RecoveryCode8DigitCode\":\"8-digit code\",\"RecoveryCodeTitle\":\"Recovery codes\",\"RecoveryCodeText\":\"To recover your account, enter one of your 8-digit recovery codes. Recovery codes are one-time codes you can use to log in to your account when you don't have access to your authentication app. Each code can be used only once.\",\"RecoveryCodeContinueButton\":\"Continue\",\"PasswordWrongFormat\":\"The password should be at least 10 characters long, should contain a lowercase letter, an uppercase letter and at least one number.\",\"GeneralErrorRequiredField\":\"Please fill in the required field.\",\"FooterCopyright\":\"ESET, spol. s r.o. - All rights reserved. Trademarks used therein are trademarks or registered trademarks of ESET, spol. s r.o. or ESET North America. All other names and brands are registered trademarks of their respective companies.\",\"FooterContact\":\"Contact\",\"FooterPrivacyPolicy\":\"Privacy Policy\",\"FooterCookies\":\"Manage cookies\",\"FooterToS\":\"Terms of Use\",\"GeneralContinue\":\"Continue\",\"SomethingWentWrong\":\"Something went wrong\",\"TryAgainBtn\":\"Try again\",\"ProblemOnOurEnd\":\"We're sorry, but we're experiencing a problem on our end.\",\"CouldNotFindPage\":\"We couldn't find that page\",\"NoLongerAvailable\":\"Looks like the page you're looking for is no longer available.\",\"GoHomeBtn\":\"Go to home page\",\"ContactTechnicalSupport\":\"If you need to contact our <0>Technical Support</0>, use this ID:\",\"TryAgain\":\"Please try again.\",\"BackBtn\":\"Back\",\"WelcomeTitle\":\"Welcome to ESET HOME\",\"SessionExpired\":\"Your session has expired due to inactivity.\",\"LogInEsetHomeBtn\":\"Log in to ESET HOME\",\"Help\":\"Help\",\"PasswordHasLowerCase\":\"1 lowercase letter\",\"PasswordHasNumber\":\"1 number\",\"PasswordHasUpperCase\":\"1 uppercase letter\",\"PasswordMinLength\":\"at least 10 characters long\",\"CreatePassword\":\"Create password\",\"CreatePasswordSuccessDesc\":\"Your password was successfully created.\",\"CreatePasswordInput\":\"New password\",\"LinkExpired\":\"Your link has expired.\",\"LinkExpiredDesc\":\"This link is not valid anymore. Please log in to ESET HOME or create an account, and you will be able to manage all your subscriptions and devices.\",\"GoLoginBtn\":\"Go to login page\",\"EnterPasswordTitle\":\"Enter your ESET HOME password\",\"EnterPasswordAccountExists\":\"An account with the email address <0>{{email}}</0> already exists.\",\"EnterPasswordInputLabel\":\"Enter password\",\"InputEmailPlaceholder\":\"Enter your email address\",\"InputEmailWrongFormat\":\"The entered email address is in the wrong format. Please use example@example.com.\",\"InputPasswordPlaceholder\":\"Enter your account password\",\"VerificationLinkExpiredTitle\":\"The verification link is invalid or has expired\",\"VerificationLinkExpiredDesc\":\"Can't find the verification link? Please check your spam or junk folder.\",\"VerificationSuccessful\":\"Verification of your account was successful.\",\"LeakedPasswordTitle\":\"Reset your password\",\"LeakedPasswordDesc\":\"The password that you're currently using for your ESET HOME account appeared in a data breach elsewhere on the internet. <0>Please reset the password to improve your security.</0>\",\"LeakedPasswordSuggestion\":\"If you're also using this password somewhere else, we strongly advise changing it.\",\"GeneralGoToHome\":\"Go to ESET HOME\",\"EsetHomeTitle\":\"How you benefit from ESET HOME\",\"EsetHomeDesc\":\"ESET HOME is a platform that gives you an overview and control over digital security for your household or small business. It's a simple and reliable way to manage your security needs and get notified about any issues.\",\"CompleteOverviewTitle\":\"Complete security overview\",\"CompleteOverviewDesc\":\"Stay informed with a comprehensive view of your security status, including detailed information about the protection of each member and device connected to your account.\",\"ManageSubscriptionTitle\":\"Easily manage your subscription\",\"ManageSubscriptionDesc\":\"Seamlessly renew your subscription, upgrade to a higher level of protection, increase your device limit, and manage your payment methods, all in one place.\",\"KeepYourDevicesProtectedTitle\":\"Keep your personal or work devices protected\",\"KeepYourDevicesProtectedDesc\":\"Secure your devices and extend protection to family, friends, or your team. Quickly download antivirus, activate VPN, and enable Identity Protection to safeguard everyone's digital life.\",\"AntiTheftTitle\":\"Anti-Theft\",\"AntiTheftDesc\":\"Secure your device against theft or loss, track its location, and prevent access to your data.\",\"TooManyRequestsTitle\":\"Too many requests\",\"TooManyRequestsDesc\":\"It seems you've made too many requests in a short time.\",\"TryAgainLater\":\"Please try again later.\",\"SocialSuccessDescription\":\"Now, finish the activation process in your ESET application.\",\"GeneralContinueToEH\":\"Continue to ESET HOME\",\"IARegistrationFirstStep\":\"Create an ESET HOME account.\",\"IARegistrationSecondStep\":\"Your <0>subscriptions will be added automatically.</0>\",\"IARegistrationThirdStep\":\"Select the <0>Add protection</0> button to download the simplified app installer.\",\"IARegistrationLearMoreAboutSubscriptions\":\"Learn more about subscriptions\",\"ConsentTitle\":\"Connect your accounts\",\"ConsentDescription\":\"By confirming, you <0>allow ESET HOME to share the 