bscription is about to expire.\",\"meaStatusLicenseMedium_0\":\"There may be an issue with the protection on {{count}} of your devices. Your subscription needs your attention.\",\"meaStatusLicenseMedium\":\"There may be an issue with the protection on {{count}} of your devices. Your subscription needs your attention.\",\"meaStatusLicenseMedium_1\":\"There may be an issue with the protection on {{count}} of your devices. Your subscription needs your attention.\",\"meaStatusLicenseMedium_2\":\"There may be an issue with the protection on {{count}} of your devices. Your subscription needs your attention.\",\"meaStatusLicenseMedium_3\":\"There may be an issue with the protection on {{count}} of your devices. Your subscription needs your attention.\",\"meaStatusLicenseMedium_plural\":\"There may be an issue with the protection on {{count}} of your devices. Your subscription needs your attention.\",\"meaStatusLicenseMedium_4\":\"There may be an issue with the protection on {{count}} of your devices. Your subscription needs your attention.\",\"meaStatusLicenseMedium_5\":\"There may be an issue with the protection on {{count}} of your devices. Your subscription needs your attention.\",\"meaStatusDeviceSevere_0\":\"{{count}} devices need your immediate attention.\",\"meaStatusDeviceSevere\":\"{{count}} device needs your immediate attention.\",\"meaStatusDeviceSevere_1\":\"{{count}} device needs your immediate attention.\",\"meaStatusDeviceSevere_2\":\"{{count}} devices need your immediate attention.\",\"meaStatusDeviceSevere_3\":\"{{count}} devices need your immediate attention.\",\"meaStatusDeviceSevere_plural\":\"{{count}} devices need your immediate attention.\",\"meaStatusDeviceSevere_4\":\"{{count}} devices need your immediate attention.\",\"meaStatusDeviceSevere_5\":\"{{count}} devices need your immediate attention.\",\"meaStatusDeviceMedium_0\":\"{{count}} devices need your attention.\",\"meaStatusDeviceMedium\":\"{{count}} device needs your attention.\",\"meaStatusDeviceMedium_1\":\"{{count}} device needs your attention.\",\"meaStatusDeviceMedium_2\":\"{{count}} devices need your attention.\",\"meaStatusDeviceMedium_3\":\"{{count}} devices need your attention.\",\"meaStatusDeviceMedium_plural\":\"{{count}} devices need your attention.\",\"meaStatusDeviceMedium_4\":\"{{count}} devices need your attention.\",\"meaStatusDeviceMedium_5\":\"{{count}} devices need your attention.\",\"meaStatusLicenseActive_0\":\"Your subscriptions are active.\",\"meaStatusLicenseActive\":\"Your subscription is active.\",\"meaStatusLicenseActive_1\":\"Your subscription is active.\",\"meaStatusLicenseActive_2\":\"Your subscriptions are active.\",\"meaStatusLicenseActive_3\":\"Your subscriptions are active.\",\"meaStatusLicenseActive_plural\":\"Your subscriptions are active.\",\"meaStatusLicenseActive_4\":\"Your subscriptions are active.\",\"meaStatusLicenseActive_5\":\"Your subscriptions are active.\",\"meaStatusProtected\":\"All your devices are protected, and protection is up to date.\",\"meaContactSupportWithErrorId\":\"If you need to contact our <0>Technical Support</0>, use this ID: <1>{{errorId}}</1>\",\"meaProtectedDevices\":\"Protected devices\",\"meaDevicesConnectedToHomeAcc\":\"Devices connected to your ESET HOME account\",\"meaProtectionSharedWithFamily\":\"People you're sharing your subscription with\",\"meaOtherDevicesProtectedByLicense\":\"Other devices protected by your subscription\",\"generalVerifyIdentity\":\"Verify identity\",\"meaStatusConnectDevice_0\":\"You can connect your device.\",\"meaStatusConnectDevice\":\"You can connect your device.\",\"meaStatusConnectDevice_1\":\"You can connect your device.\",\"meaStatusConnectDevice_2\":\"You can connect your devices.\",\"meaStatusConnectDevice_3\":\"You can connect your devices.\",\"meaStatusConnectDevice_plural\":\"You can connect your devices.\",\"meaStatusConnectDevice_4\":\"You can connect your devices.\",\"meaStatusConnectDevice_5\":\"You can connect your devices.\",\"meaProtectionUpdateAvailable\":\"Protection update available\",\"meaProtectionUpToDate\":\"Protection up to date\",\"meaProductVersion\":\"Application version\",\"meaUnprotect\":\"Unprotect\",\"generalON\":\"ON\",\"generalOFF\":\"OFF\",\"meaAutoRenewalDistributorToDisable\":\"To disable auto-renewal for this subscription, please contact your subscription distributor.\",\"meaManageAutoRenewal\":\"Manage auto-renewal\",\"meaManageAutoRenewalDesc\":\"Review or change auto-renewal settings for this subscription.\",\"meaManageSubscription\":\"Manage subscription\",\"meaManageSubscriptionDesc\":\"Manage your plan and related subscription settings.\",\"meaUnsubscribe\":\"Unsubscribe\",\"meaResubscribe\":\"Resubscribe\",\"meaWelcomeToEsetHome\":\"Welcome to ESET HOME\",\"meaGetStarted\":\"Get started\",\"meaDeviceProtect\":\"Protect device\",\"meaProtectADeviceTitle\":\"Protect a device\",\"meaExploreFeature\":\"Explore feature\",\"meaGetStartedTitle\":\"Let's start enjoying your ESET HOME account!\",\"meaGetStartedSubtitle\":\"What would you like to do?\",\"meaGetStartedAddLicenseCardTitle\":\"Add a subscription & download protection\",\"meaGetStartedAddLicenseCardText\":\"Enter your activation key and activate protection.\",\"meaPurchaseLicenseTitle\":\"Buy a subscription\",\"meaGetStartedPurchaseLicenseCardText\":\"Explore our products and choose one that best suits your security needs.\",\"meaGetStartedTrialLicenseCardText\":\"Start a free trial and protect your device for a limited time.\",\"meaProtectThisDevice\":\"Protect this device\",\"meaProtectOtherDevice\":\"Protect another device\",\"meaProtectOtherDeviceText\":\"Set up protection on another device you own.\",\"meaOSRequiredTitle\":\"This link can't be opened on your current device\",\"meaOSRequiredDescription\":\"To continue your product activation, open the link from the email on the {{os}} device you want to protect.\",\"meaLicenseKeyConvertTitle\":\"Changes to the product activation method\",\"meaLicenseKeyConvertText\":\"ESET products can no longer be activated using the username and password activation method. To activate your product, use the <0>activation key</0> provided in the subscription details email you received. If you have an <1>ESET HOME account</1>, you can also find the activation key in the subscription overview.\",\"meaLicenseKeyConvertText2\":\"If you can't find the email and don't have an ESET HOME account, please contact our Technical Support.\",\"meaMe\":\"Me\",\"meaSecurityFeatureInvited\":\"Invited\",\"meaSecurityFeaturePwmActivated\":\"Password Manager activated\",\"meaSecurityFeaturePwmNotActivated\":\"Password Manager not activated\",\"meaSecurityFeaturePWMActivatedStatusOnly\":\"Activated\",\"meaSecurityFeaturePWMNotActivatedStatusOnly\":\"Not activated\",\"meaSecurityFeaturePwmDescription\":\"Take control of passwords with Password Manager. Activate or deactivate it for this user here.\",\"meaActivate\":\"Activate\",\"meaDeactivate\":\"Deactivate\",\"meaPwmActivation\":\"Password Manager activation\",\"meaBackToFeatures\":\"Back\",\"meaFeaturesTitle\":\"Features\",\"meaAntiTheftShortDesc\":\"Secure your device against theft or loss. Easily lock, track and locate devices to protect your privacy and prevent unauthorized access to your data.\",\"meaUpgradeSubscription\":\"Upgrade subscription\",\"meaUpgradeSubscriptionDesc\":\"Upgrade this subscription to unlock more security features and advanced protection.\",\"meaSetupInstructionsSent\":\"Setup instructions sent to email.\",\"meaSetupInstructionsSentToEmail\":\"Setup instructions sent to {{emailAddress}}. It may take up to 24 hours for the email to arrive.\",\"meaSendInstructions\":\"Send instructions\",\"meaVpn\":\"VPN\",\"meaDownloadVpnTitle\":\"Download VPN\",\"meaDownloadVpnBtn\":\"Download VPN\",\"meaInstructionsSentTitle\":\"Instructions were sent to email\",\"meaIdentityProtectionComingSoon\":\"Identity Protection is coming soon\",\"meaIdentityProtectionDescription\":\"Stay tuned for the upcoming Identity Protection security feature. This powerful feature will protect you from identity theft, monitor the dark web for data breaches and leaked customer information, and more.\",\"meaIdentityProtectionActivation\":\"Identity Protection activation\",\"meaIdentityProtectionOpenPortal\":\"Open the Identity Protection portal and log in to your account to get access to identity and credit monitoring, recovery services and more. Identity Protection helps prevent identity theft and scans the dark web for leaked customer data.\",\"meaIdentityProtectionNoActivationEmail\":\"If you didn't find the activation email, check your spam folder.\",\"meaIdentityProtectionPreventIdentityTheft\":\"Prevent identity theft - this feature scans the dark web for leaked customer data. It offers identity and credit monitoring, recovery services and more.\",\"meaIdentityProtectionFollowSteps\":\"Activate Identity Protection by following the steps on this screen.\",\"meaIdentityProtectionOpenBtn\":\"Open Identity Protection\",\"meaIdentityProtection\":\"Identity Protection\",\"meaIdentityProtectionNavigateDigitalWorld\":\"Confidently navigate the digital world with peace of mind, knowing your identity is protected.\",\"meaIdentityProtectionCheckMailbox\":\"<0>Check your mailbox</0> for an activation email and follow the steps there to create an account on the Identity Protection portal.\",\"meaIdentityProtectionClickBtn\":\"Select the \\\"Activate\\\" button to activate Identity Protection.\",\"meaIdentityProtection2FANeeded\":\"Before you proceed with Identity Protection activation, you must set up <0>Two-Factor Authentication</0>. This step adds an extra security layer to your account, requiring a second form of verification in addition to your password.\",\"meaIdentityProtectionPasswordNeededTitle\":\"Create a password for your ESET HOME account\",\"meaIdentityProtectionPasswordNeededDescription\":\"We've noticed you're using social login. Please start by <0>creating a password for your ESET HOME account.</0> You'll need it to set up Two-Factor Authentication in the next step.\",\"meaIdentityProtectionCompleteTheseSteps\":\"<0>To activate Identity Protection</0>, you'll need to complete these steps:\",\"meaIdentityProtectionCreatePassword\":\"Create a password for your ESET HOME account\",\"meaIdentityProtectionSetup2FA\":\"Set up Two-Factor Authentication\",\"meaIdentityProtectionFillOutForm\":\"Fill out the activation form\",\"meaIdentityProtectionEmpowerYourSecurity\":\"Empower your security with Identity Protection. This feature helps prevent identity theft and scans the dark web for leaked customer data, offering continuous monitoring. Receive regular updates on your identity status, ensuring you're promptly informed about any potential data breaches or security risks.\",\"meaIdentityProtectionAddYourInfo\":\"Please add your personal information. We'll monitor this data for any security-related issues.\",\"meaIdentityProtectionFirstName\":\"First name\",\"meaIdentityProtectionFirstNamePlaceholder\":\"Enter your first name\",\"meaIdentityProtectionLastName\":\"Last name\",\"meaIdentityProtectionLastNamePlaceholder\":\"Enter your last name\",\"meaIdentityProtectionStreet\":\"Street\",\"meaIdentityProtectionStreetPlaceholder\":\"Enter your street\",\"meaIdentityProtectionCity\":\"City\",\"meaIdentityProtectionCityPlaceholder\":\"Enter your city\",\"meaIdentityProtectionPostalCode\":\"Postal code\",\"meaIdentityProtectionPostalCodePlaceholder\":\"Enter your postal code\",\"meaIdentityProtectionCountry\":\"Country\",\"meaIdentityProtectionCountryPlaceholder\":\"Select your country\",\"meaIdentityProtectionActivationSuccessMessage\":\"Identity Protection was activated\",\"meaIdentityProtectionDashboard\":\"Dashboard\",\"meaIdentityProtectionAlerts\":\"Alerts\",\"meaIdentityProtectionMonitoredInfo\":\"Monitored information\",\"meaIdentityProtectionAlertsCardTitle\":\"Identity Protection alerts\",\"meaIdentityProtectionAlertsCardDescription\":\"To check for any issues related to your identity and personal information, visit the <0>Alerts</0> section. You'll also receive email notifications whenever there's an alert.\",\"meaIdentityProtectionViewAlerts\":\"View alerts\",\"meaIdentityProtectionDarkWebScanCardTitle\":\"Dark web scan\",\"meaIdentityProtectionDarkWebScanCardDescription\":\"We continuously scan the dark web for potential fraud and suspicious activity linked to your personal information.\",\"meaIdentityProtectionWhatIsCardTitle\":\"What is Identity Protection?\",\"meaIdentityProtectionWhatIsCardDescription1\":\"Identity Protection is a powerful security feature designed to help prevent identity theft, monitor the dark web for data breaches and leaked customer information, and promptly alert you via email about any suspicious activity related to your personal information.\",\"meaIdentityProtectionWhatIsCardDescription2\":\"Explore <0>Alerts</0> to get an overview of issues related to your identity and monitored personal information. You can update the data you want us to monitor in the <1>Monitored information</1> section anytime.\",\"meaIdentityProtectionDeactivationCardTitle\":\"Identity Protection deactivation\",\"meaIdentityProtectionDeactivationCardDescription\":\"To deactivate Identity Protection, simply click the button below. Deactivating this feature stops the dark web scan and removes all your monitored data.\",\"meaIdentityProtectionDeactivate\":\"Deactivate Identity Protection\",\"meaIdentityProtectionVerifyTitle\":\"To continue, verify it's you\",\"meaIdentityProtectionDeactivateTitle\":\"Deactivate Identity Protection\",\"meaIdentityProtectionDeactivateBody1\":\"Deactivating Identity Protection will remove all data from your Monitored information section, disable email notifications, and stop dark web scanning for your personal information.\",\"meaIdentityProtectionDeactivateBody2\":\"You can reactivate this feature later if you have an eligible subscription with an available Identity Protection activation.\",\"meaIdentityProtectionSuccessfullyDeactivated\":\"Identity Protection was deactivated\",\"meaIdentityProtectionVerifyDescription\":\"To continue the activation process, enter your ESET HOME account password and the 6-digit code from your Two-Factor Authentication app in the next steps.\",\"meaIdentityProtectionLoginDescription\":\"Empower your security with Identity Protection. This feature helps prevent identity theft and scans the dark web for leaked customer data, offering continuous monitoring. Receive regular updates on your identity status, ensuring you're promptly informed about any potential data breaches or security risks.\",\"meaIdentityProtectionLoginAditionalInfo\":\"To use Identity Protection, Two-Factor Authentication must be enabled to add an extra security layer to your account.\",\"meaIdentityProtectionPersonalInfoTitle\":\"Personal information\",\"meaIdentityProtectionPersonalInfoDesc\":\"To help us protect your identity effectively, consider adding as much information as possible. This enables us to consistently monitor your data, swiftly detecting potential fraud or misuse.\",\"meaIdentityProtectionAddressTitle\":\"Address\",\"meaIdentityProtectionAdditionalEmailAddressesTitle\":\"Additional email addresses\",\"meaIdentityProtectionAdditionalEmailAddressesDesc\":\"You can add up to 9 extra email addresses for continuous monitoring and receive alerts whenever these addresses are detected in fraudulent or suspicious activity.\",\"meaIdentityProtectionEmailAddressAlreadyMonitored\":\"This email address is already monitored. Please use a different one.\",\"meaIdentityProtectionIbanAlreadyMonitored\":\"This IBAN is already monitored. Please use a different one.\",\"meaIdentityProtectionBankAccountAlreadyMonitored\":\"This bank account is already monitored. Please use a different one.\",\"meaIdentityProtectionAdditionalEmailLabel1\":\"Email address 1\",\"meaIdentityProtectionAdditionalEmailLabel2\":\"Email address 2\",\"meaIdentityProtectionAdditionalEmailLabel3\":\"Email address 3\",\"meaIdentityProtectionAdditionalEmailLabel4\":\"Email address 4\",\"meaIdentityProtectionAdditionalEmailLabel5\":\"Email address 5\",\"meaIdentityProtectionAdditionalEmailLabel6\":\"Email address 6\",\"meaIdentityProtectionAdditionalEmailLabel7\":\"Email address 7\",\"meaIdentityProtectionAdditionalEmailLabel8\":\"Email address 8\",\"meaIdentityProtectionAdditionalEmailLabel9\":\"Email address 9\",\"meaIdentityProtectionAdditionalEmailLabel1Usage\":\"(1/9)\",\"meaIdentityProtectionAdditionalEmailLabel2Usage\":\"(2/9)\",\"meaIdentityProtectionAdditionalEmailLabel3Usage\":\"(3/9)\",\"meaIdentityProtectionAdditionalEmailLabel4Usage\":\"(4/9)\",\"meaIdentityProtectionAdditionalEmailLabel5Usage\":\"(5/9)\",\"meaIdentityProtectionAdditionalEmailLabel6Usage\":\"(6/9)\",\"meaIdentityProtectionAdditionalEmailLabel7Usage\":\"(7/9)\",\"meaIdentityProtectionAdditionalEmailLabel8Usage\":\"(8/9)\",\"meaIdentityProtectionAdditionalEmailLabel9Usage\":\"(9/9)\",\"meaIdentityProtectionIbanLabel1\":\"IBAN 1\",\"meaIdentityProtectionIbanLabel2\":\"IBAN 2\",\"meaIdentityProtectionIbanLabel3\":\"IBAN 3\",\"meaIdentityProtectionIbanLabel4\":\"IBAN 4\",\"meaIdentityProtectionIbanLabel5\":\"IBAN 5\",\"meaIdentityProtectionIbanLabel6\":\"IBAN 6\",\"meaIdentityProtectionIbanLabel7\":\"IBAN 7\",\"meaIdentityProtectionIbanLabel8\":\"IBAN 8\",\"meaIdentityProtectionIbanLabel9\":\"IBAN 9\",\"meaIdentityProtectionIbanLabel10\":\"IBAN 10\",\"meaIdentityProtectionBankAccountLabel1\":\"Bank account 1\",\"meaIdentityProtectionBankAccountLabel2\":\"Bank account 2\",\"meaIdentityProtectionBankAccountLabel3\":\"Bank account 3\",\"meaIdentityProtectionBankAccountLabel4\":\"Bank account 4\",\"meaIdentityProtectionBankAccountLabel5\":\"Bank account 5\",\"meaIdentityProtectionBankAccountLabel6\":\"Bank account 6\",\"meaIdentityProtectionBankAccountLabel7\":\"Bank account 7\",\"meaIdentityProtectionBankAccountLabel8\":\"Bank account 8\",\"meaIdentityProtectionBankAccountLabel9\":\"Bank account 9\",\"meaIdentityProtectionBankAccountLabel10\":\"Bank account 10\",\"meaIdentityProtectionFinancialInfoLabel1Usage\":\"(1/10)\",\"meaIdentityProtectionFinancialInfoLabel2Usage\":\"(2/10)\",\"meaIdentityProtectionFinancialInfoLabel3Usage\":\"(3/10)\",\"meaIdentityProtectionFinancialInfoLabel4Usage\":\"(4/10)\",\"meaIdentityProtectionFinancialInfoLabel5Usage\":\"(5/10)\",\"meaIdentityProtectionFinancialInfoLabel6Usage\":\"(6/10)\",\"meaIdentityProtectionFinancialInfoLabel7Usage\":\"(7/10)\",\"meaIdentityProtectionFinancialInfoLabel8Usage\":\"(8/10)\",\"meaIdentityProtectionFinancialInfoLabel9Usage\":\"(9/10)\",\"meaIdentityProtectionFinancialInfoLabel10Usage\":\"(10/10)\",\"meaDownloadPwm\":\"Download Password Manager\",\"meaDownloadPwmDesc\":\"Download our app on your phone or tablet, or get a browser extension to manage and securely store your passwords. After installation, create your Password Manager account to get started.\",\"meaDownloadPwmExtension\":\"Extension for your browser:\",\"meaDownloadPwmPhone\":\"App for your phone and tablet:\",\"meaDownloadPwmMoreInfoLink\":\"Find more information about the app and extension <0>here</0>\",\"meaSecurityFeaturePwmSetupNeededMeProfile\":\"Password Manager - setup needed\",\"meaSecurityFeaturePwmSetupNeededOtherProfile\":\"Password Manager - invited\",\"meaSecurityFeatureSetupNeeded\":\"Setup needed\",\"meaUninvite\":\"Uninvite\",\"meaChangeSubscriptionBtn\":\"Change subscription\",\"meaChangeSubscriptionTitle\":\"Change subscription\",\"meaPwmYouAreStepAway\":\"You're just a step away from enhanced password security.\",\"meaPwmSendInstructionsToYou\":\"Select <0>Send instructions</0> to send the necessary steps for getting started to your email at <1>{{emailAddress}}</1>.\",\"meaPwmProfileIsStepAway\":\"<0>{{emailAddress}}</0> is just a step away from enhanced password security.\",\"meaPwmSendInstructionsToThem\":\"Select <0>Send instructions</0> to send the necessary steps for getting started to their email at <1>{{emailAddress}}</1>.\",\"meaPwmYouInstructionsSent\":\"The instructions for setting up Password Manager were sent to <0>{{emailAddress}}</0>\",\"meaPwmYouToStart\":\"To start using the Password Manager:\",\"meaPwmYouDownload\":\"Download our Password Manager app on your phone or tablet, or add the extension to your browser\",\"meaPwmYouCreateStore\":\"Create a Password Manager account using the same email address to which you received the instructions\",\"meaPwmThemInstructionsSent\":\"The instructions for setting up Password Manager were sent to <0>{{profileName}}</0> at <1>{{emailAddress}}</1>\",\"meaPwmThemToStart\":\"To start using the Password Manager, the recipient needs to do the following steps:\",\"meaPwmThemDownload\":\"Download our Password Manager app to their phone or tablet, or add the extension to their browser\",\"meaPwmThemCreateStore\":\"Create a Password Manager account using the same email address to which they received the instructions\",\"meaPwmEmailInUse\":\"Email address in use\",\"meaPwmEmailInUseDesc\":\"The Password Manager is already associated with the email address <0>{{emailAddress}}</0>. Each user can only use one Password Manager per email address.\",\"meaPwmDeactivate\":\"Deactivate Password Manager\",\"meaPwmDeactivateBtn\":\"Deactivate Password Manager\",\"meaPwmDeactivateDesc\":\"You're about to deactivate the Password Manager for:\",\"meaPwmDeactivateGracePeriod\":\"If you deactivate the Password Manager for this person, they will have <0>60 days to transfer their passwords</0>. After this period, both the Password Manager app and extension will become inactive.\",\"meaPwmDeactivateFreeUp\":\"The freed-up Password Manager activation can then be used for someone else.\",\"meaPwmDeactivated\":\"Password Manager deactivated\",\"meaPwmSubscriptionChanged\":\"Password Manager subscription changed\",\"meaAssociatedSubscriptionChangedSuccessfully\":\"Subscription associated with <0>{{homeProfileName}}</0> was successfully changed.\",\"meaPwmSubscriptionChangeDetail\":\"You can switch the subscription associated with Password Manager for <0>{{homeProfileName}}</0>. This is helpful when the current subscription is about to expire or if you prefer a subscription with more available slots.\",\"meaActionNeeded\":\"Action needed\",\"meaPwmActionNeeded\":\"Password Manager - Action needed\",\"meaPwmReactivationInstructionsSentTitle\":\"A reactivation email was sent\",\"meaPwmReactivationInstructionsSent\":\"A reactivation email for Password Manager was sent to <0>{{profileName}}</0>\",\"meaPwmReactivationInstructionsSentDescription\":\"The instructions on how to use the Password Manager app and browser extension are included in the email.\",\"pwmWelcomeThankYou\":\"Thank you for choosing ESET Password Manager\",\"pwmWelcomeHelpsYou\":\"ESET Password Manager helps you to\",\"pwmWelcomeNeverForgetPassword\":\"Never forget your passwords again\",\"pwmWelcomeCreateStrongPasswords\":\"Create strong new password\",\"pwmWelcomeIncreaseSecurity\":\"Increase the security of your accounts\",\"pwmWelcomeAndMore\":\"... and much more\",\"pwmWelcomeLoginSteps\":\"To start enjoying all the handy features ESET Password Manager offers, <0>click the extension icon</0> next to the address bar. In some browsers, it may be hidden in the browser menu.\",\"pwmDidYouHaveProblem\":\"Having a problem? Visit our <0>Online Help</0>.\",\"pwmWeAreSorry\":\"We are sorry that you've uninstalled <0/>ESET Password Manager\",\"pwmWeWouldLove\":\"We would love to welcome you back!\",\"pwmInstallBrowserExt\":\"Install browser extension\",\"meaProtection\":\"Protection\",\"meaSubscriptions\":\"Subscriptions\",\"meaHelpAndSupport\":\"Help and support\",\"meaSettings\":\"Settings\",\"meaProgressProtected\":\"Progress. Protected.\",\"meaConnectDeviceMenu\":\"Connect device\",\"pwmVerifySuccessTitle\":\"Thank you for verifying your email address\",\"pwmVerifySuccessDescription\":\"You can now continue with the Password Manager account creation you started earlier in your Password Manager app or browser extension.\",\"pwmVerifySuccessPrimaryBtn\":\"Continue in browser\",\"pwmVerifySuccessSecondaryBtn\":\"Need help? Learn more\",\"pwmVerifyPartialSuccessTitle\":\"Thank you for verifying your email address\",\"pwmVerifyPartialSuccessDescription\":\"You're one step closer to finishing your account creation and fully enjoying ESET Password Manager.\",\"pwmVerifyPartialSuccessNext\":\"What to do next?\",\"pwmVerifyPartialSuccessStep1\":\"<0>1. Go to ESET HOME</0> and open Security features. Activate the Password Manager for an existing profile or create a new one.\",\"pwmVerifyPartialSuccessStep2\":\"<0>2. Complete the Password Manager account creation</0> you started earlier in your Password Manager app or browser extension.\",\"pwmVerifyPartialSuccessPrimaryBtn\":\"Continue to ESET HOME\",\"pwmVerifyPartialSuccessSecondaryBtn\":\"Need help? Learn more\",\"pwmVerifyInvalidTitle\":\"Verification link is invalid or has expired\",\"pwmVerifyInvalidDescription\":\"If the account registration process is still in progress in your Password Manager app or browser extension, you can resend the verification email from there. Otherwise, start creating an account again.\",\"pwmVerifyInvalidPrimaryBtn\":\"Create account\",\"pwmVerifyInvalidSecondaryBtn\":\"Need help? Learn more\",\"pwmVerifyErrorTitle\":\"Something went wrong\",\"pwmVerifyErrorDescription\":\"Please try again.\",\"pwmVerifyErrorPrimaryBtn\":\"Try again\",\"pwmVerifyErrorSecondaryBtn\":\"If the problem persists, contact <0>ESET Technical Support</0>.\",\"pwmExtensionRedirectTitle\":\"You're being redirected to the Password Manager browser extension...\",\"pwmExtensionRedirectDescription\":\"Please wait. This can take a few moments.\",\"pwmDownloadManually\":\"Your download should start automatically in a few seconds. If it doesn't, <0>start the download manually</0>.\",\"pwmAddToFirefox\":\"Add the ESET Password Manager browser extension\",\"pwmFirefoxStep1\":\"Click the \\\"Continue to installation\\\" button.\",\"pwmFirefoxStep2\":\"Click the \\\"Install\\\" button to add Password Manager to Firefox.\",\"pwmFirefoxStep3\":\"After that, click the Password Manager icon to start.\",\"meaActivatedProtection\":\"Activated protection\",\"meaGeneralProtection\":\"Antivirus for: {{operatingSystems}}\",\"meaGeneralProtectionWindows\":\"Windows\",\"meaGeneralProtectionmacOS\":\"macOS\",\"meaGeneralProtectionAndroid\":\"Android\",\"meaServerProtection\":\"Antivirus for: Windows Server\",\"meaProtectionUsed\":\"Used: <0>{{used}}</0> out of <1>{{total}}</1>\",\"meaHowToDownloadLatestVersion\":\"How to download the latest version\",\"meaChooseTrialSubscriptionTitle\":\"Choose your free 30-day trial\",\"meaChooseTrialSubscriptionEshpOrEsbsSubTitle\":\"Choose protection for your home or small business and select <0>Continue</0>.\",\"meaChooseTrialSubscriptionProtectHomeTitle\":\"Protect your home\",\"meaChooseTrialSubscriptionProtectBusinessTitle\":\"Protect your small business\",\"meaChooseTrialSubscriptionEhspDescription\":\"Explore powerful, multilayered protection tailored for your home. Try ESET HOME Security Premium for free for 30 days and secure your devices against threats.\",\"meaChooseTrialSubscriptionEsbsDescription\":\"Get comprehensive, user-friendly protection designed for your small business. Try ESET Small Business Security for free for 30 days and keep your business safe from threats.\",\"meaChooseTrialSubscriptionAlreadyUsedInfo\":\"You've already used this free trial in the past. We invite you to <0>try our free Android protection</0> instead.\",\"meaChooseTrialSubscriptionNoTrialsTitle\":\"No free 30-day trials available\",\"meaChooseTrialSubscriptionNoTrialsDescription\":\"It seems you've already used your free trials. Explore alternative options below.\",\"meaChooseTrialSubscriptionTryAndroidTitle\":\"Try our free Android protection\",\"meaChooseTrialSubscriptionTryAndroidDescription\":\"Protect your Android device with our free version of ESET Mobile Security for Android. It provides essential features with no subscription expiration.\",\"meaChooseTrialSubscriptionBuyNewTitle\":\"Buy a new subscription\",\"meaChooseTrialSubscriptionBuyNewDescription\":\"Upgrade your current free trial to a full subscription with the option to increase the device limit, or buy a new subscription that best suits your needs.\",\"meaChooseTrialSubscriptionNoTrialsIOSTitle\":\"Trial unavailable\",\"meaChooseTrialSubscriptionNoTrialsIOSDescription\":\"There are currently no free trials available because you might have already used them in the past.\",\"meaChooseTrialSubscriptionActivatedTitle\":\"Your free trial was successfully activated\",\"meaChooseTrialSubscriptionActivatedDescription\":\"Your trial is set! Choose your next step and select <0>Continue</0>.\",\"meaChooseTrialSubscriptionActivatedStartProtectTitle\":\"Start protecting devices\",\"meaChooseTrialSubscriptionActivatedStartProtectDescription\":\"With your free trial now activated, you can start protecting your devices with ease.\",\"meaChooseTrialSubscriptionActivatedViewTrialDetailsTitle\":\"View trial details\",\"meaChooseTrialSubscriptionActivatedViewTrialDetailsDescription\":\"We've added your free trial to your subscriptions. From there, you can check the details about the trial and the included security features.\",\"meaAddOrBuy\":\"Add or buy\",\"meaSubscriptionSuggestion\":\"Here, you'll find all your subscriptions conveniently listed. Easily manage each one from this page.\",\"meaAddSubscriptionDescription\":\"Add a subscription using the <0>activation key</0> found in an email you received from us or on the subscription card included in your boxed product.\",\"meaAddSubscriptionDescription2\":\"To <0>renew or manage an existing subscription</0>, go to the subscription details.\",\"meaAddSubscriptionDescriptionSub\":\"To <0>renew existing subscriptions</0>, go to the subscription detail and select the renew icon in the Manage subscription section.\",\"meaHowToRenewSubscription\":\"How to renew an existing subscription?\",\"meaBuyNowBtn\":\"Buy now\",\"meaSubscriptionOptions\":\"Subscription options\",\"subscriptionAdd\":\"Add\",\"meaIdentityProtectionYourInformationFoundOnDarkWeb\":\"Your information has been found on the dark web: {{codeName}}\",\"meaIdentityProtectionAccountTakeoverRisk\":\"Account takeover risk: Your information has been found on the dark web: {{codeName}}\",\"meaIdentityProtectionDetails\":\"Details\",\"meaIdentityProtectionViewAlert\":\"View alert\",\"meaIdentityProtectionFieldCity\":\"City\",\"meaIdentityProtectionFieldZip\":\"Postal code\",\"meaIdentityProtectionFieldAddress\":\"Address\",\"meaIdentityProtectionFieldSurname\":\"Surname\",\"meaIdentityProtectionFieldCountry\":\"Country\",\"meaIdentityProtectionFieldName\":\"Name\",\"meaIdentityProtectionFieldEmailAddress\":\"Email address\",\"meaIdentityProtectionFieldUsername\":\"Username\",\"meaIdentityProtectionFieldPassword\":\"Password\",\"meaIdentityProtectionFieldSourceCategory\":\"Source category\",\"meaIdentityProtectionFieldIBAN\":\"IBAN\",\"meaIdentityProtectionFieldBankAccount\":\"Bank account\",\"meaIdentityProtectionRecommendations\":\"Recommendations\",\"meaIdentityProtectionChangeAccountPassword\":\"Change your account password and update it on any other services where you've used the same password as soon as possible. This helps ensure the safety of your accounts and personal information. Stay alert for any suspicious emails or messages related to your identity.\",\"meaIdentityProtectionStayAlert\":\"Stay alert for any unusual activity. There's a chance that some individuals might try to use the collected data to pretend to be you or trick you. Be cautious of any suspicious emails or messages related to your identity.\",\"meaIdentityProtectionBreachName\":\"Breach name\",\"meaIdentityProtectionBreachDate\":\"Breach date\",\"meaIdentityProtectionDetailInformationFoundOnDarkWeb\":\"You received this alert because we found your information being traded on the dark web.\",\"meaIdentityProtectionDarkWebInfoTooltip\":\"The dark web is home to thousands of illegal websites criminals use to buy and sell stolen information.\",\"meaIdentityProtectionPasswordEncrypted\":\"Encrypted\",\"meaIdentityProtectionNoAlerts\":\"There are no alerts at this moment.\",\"meaIdentityProtectionNameConstraint\":\"Allowed characters: Latin letters with diacritics, spaces, and some special characters (-).\",\"meaIdentityProtectionCityConstraint\":\"Allowed characters: Latin letters with diacritics, spaces, and some special characters (.).\",\"meaIdentityProtectionPostalConstraint\":\"Allowed characters: Latin letters, digits, spaces, and some special characters (-).\",\"meaIdentityProtectionStreetConstraint\":\"Allowed characters: Latin letters with diacritics, digits, spaces, and some special characters (- # / . ,).\",\"meaIdentityProtectionEmailConstraint\":\"Allowed characters: Latin letters, digits, and some special characters (@ + - _ .).\",\"meaIdentityProtectionIbanLatinConstraint\":\"Allowed characters: uppercase Latin letters, spaces and digits.\",\"meaIdentityProtectionIbanFormatConstraint\":\"The IBAN is in the wrong format.\",\"meaIdentityProtectionDuplicatedEmailConstraint\":\"This email address is already in another field. Please use a different one.\",\"meaIdentityProtectionDuplicatedIbanConstraint\":\"This IBAN is already in another field. Please use a different one.\",\"meaIdentityProtectionDuplicatedBankAccountConstraint\":\"This bank account is already in another field. Please use a different one.\",\"meaIdentityProtectionMonitoredFinancialInfoCardTitle\":\"Financial information\",\"meaIdentityProtectionMonitoredFinancialInfoCardDesc\":\"Enter your bank account numbers here to enable continuous dark web monitoring. We'll alert you if your information is found being used fraudulently. You can enter up to 10 IBANs and 10 bank accounts.\",\"meaIdentityProtectionMonitoredIbanInputPlaceholder\":\"Enter your IBAN\",\"meaIdentityProtectionMonitoredBankAccountInputPlaceholder\":\"Enter your bank account number\",\"meaIdentityProtectionMonitoredEmailInputPlaceholder\":\"Enter your email address\",\"meaIdentityProtectionAddMonitoredItemBtn\":\"Add\",\"meaViewActivityFeed\":\"View activity feed\",\"meaDeleteAll\":\"Delete all\",\"meaDeleteNotificationsTitle\":\"Delete all notifications\",\"meaDeleteNotificationsDesc\":\"Are you sure you want to delete all notifications?\",\"meaDeleteNotificationsBtn\":\"Delete\",\"meaNotificationsDeletedTitle\":\"All notifications were deleted\",\"meaSideMenuExpandTooltip\":\"Expand\",\"meaVerifyEmailToDeleteAccountTitle\":\"Check your email to verify your identity\",\"meaVerifyEmailToDeleteAccountDesc\":\"To delete your ESET HOME account, you must first verify your identity by selecting the link we've sent to your email <0>{{accountEmailAddress}}</0>. Once you verify your identity, you'll be able to delete your account.\",\"meaMembersTitle\":\"Members\",\"meaMembersAddBtn\":\"Add member\",\"meaMembersEditTitle\":\"Edit member\",\"meaMembersEditDesc\":\"Edit this member's name or email address.\",\"meaMembersAllMembers\":\"All members\",\"meaMembersNoMembersTitle\":\"No members yet\",\"meaMembersNoMembersDesc\":\"Add members of your home or small business to manage their protection and keep them secure.\",\"meaShowMoreNotifications_0\":\"{{count}} more notifications\",\"meaShowMoreNotifications\":\"{{count}} more notification\",\"meaShowMoreNotifications_1\":\"{{count}} more notification\",\"meaShowMoreNotifications_2\":\"{{count}} more notifications\",\"meaShowMoreNotifications_3\":\"{{count}} more notifications\",\"meaShowMoreNotifications_plural\":\"{{count}} more notifications\",\"meaShowMoreNotifications_4\":\"{{count}} more notifications\",\"meaShowMoreNotifications_5\":\"{{count}} more notifications\",\"meaShowLessNotifications\":\"Show less\",\"meaAddAccountOwnerMemberTitle\":\"Start by adding yourself\",\"meaAddAccountOwnerMemberDesc\":\"To begin adding members, add yourself first. <0>In the next step</0>, you'll be able to protect your devices.\",\"meaAddAccountOwnerMemberEmailAlert\":\"Your email can't be changed here because it must match your account email.\",\"meaAccountOwnerMemberAddedModalTitle\":\"You're now a member\",\"meaAccountOwnerMemberAddedModalDesc\":\"You can start protecting your devices now or come back to it later.\",\"meaAddMemberNamePlaceholder\":\"John Doe\",\"meaAccountOwner\":\"Account owner\",\"meaAddOtherMemberTitle\":\"Add a member\",\"meaAddOtherMemberDesc\":\"<0>In the next step</0>, you'll be able to protect this member's devices.\",\"meaAddOtherMemberModalDesc\":\"Enter the name and email address of the person you want to add.\",\"meaOtherMemberAddedModalTitle\":\"Member added successfully\",\"meaOtherMemberAddedModalDesc\":\"You can start protecting this member's devices now or come back to it later.\",\"meaAddOtherMemberModalSuccessDesc\":\"{{name}} was added as a member.\",\"meaMemberLimitReachedModalTitle\":\"Member limit reached\",\"meaMemberLimitReachedModalDesc\":\"To create a new member, delete some of the existing ones.\",\"meaMemberUniqueNameConstraint\":\"This name is already in use. Please choose a different one.\",\"meaAntivirus\":\"Antivirus\",\"meaAllDevicesTab\":\"All devices\",\"meaDevicesWithAntivirus\":\"Devices with antivirus\",\"meaDevicesNoLinkedMember\":\"Devices without a linked member\",\"meaNoDevicesTitle\":\"No devices yet\",\"meaNoDevicesDesc\":\"Once you add members, you'll see their protected devices here. Start by adding members to manage their protection.\",\"meaRenameMemberContextMenu\":\"Rename\",\"meaEditMemberContextMenu\":\"Edit\",\"meaDeleteMemberContextMenu\":\"Delete\",\"meaRenameMemberModalTitle\":\"Rename member\",\"meaRenameMemberModalDesc\":\"Enter a new name for this member.\",\"meaRenameMemberModalSuccessTitle\":\"Name changed successfully\",\"meaRenameMemberNameLabel\":\"New name\",\"meaRenameMemberSubmitButton\":\"Rename member\",\"meaAuthorizationMethodBiometrics\":\"Biometrics\",\"meaAuthorizationMethodPin\":\"PIN\",\"meaDeviceNotifications\":\"Notifications\",\"meaDeviceOptions\":\"Options\",\"meaLinkedMemberTitle\":\"Linked member\",\"meaDeviceDetails\":\"Details\",\"meaLinkDeviceToMember\":\"Easily link this device to a member.\",\"meaLinkedDeviceToMember\":\"This device is currently linked to <0>{{memberName}}</0>.\",\"meaRemoveProtectionTitle\":\"Remove protection\",\"meaRemoveProtectionDescription\":\"Unprotect this device to free up the activation for a different one.\",\"meaRemoveProtectionModalAlert\":\"This process may take a few minutes to complete.\",\"meaRemoveProtectionModalDescription\":\"You're about to deactivate the product on <0>{{deviceName}}</0>. This device will no longer be protected or listed among devices with antivirus protection.\",\"meaRemoveProtectionBtn\":\"Remove protection\",\"meaRemoveProtectionModalSuccessTitle\":\"Removing protection\",\"meaRemoveProtectionModalSuccessDescription\":\"This may take a few minutes.\",\"meaOperatingSystem\":\"Operating system\",\"meaViewSubscriptionBtn\":\"View subscription\",\"meaInstalledProduct\":\"Installed application\",\"meaLastProductUpdate\":\"Last application update\",\"meaIdentityProtectionUS\":\"Identity Protection (US)\",\"meaIdentityProtectionDisplayUnitsDescription\":\"Protect your identity against theft and misuse with continuous dark web monitoring, keeping you informed of potential data breaches and security risks.\",\"meaIdentityProtectionDisplayUnitsNoteEmptyState\":\"You don't currently use Identity Protection\",\"meaIdentityProtectionDisplayUnitsNoteUpsell\":\"You're missing a subscription to activate Identity Protection\",\"meaIdentityProtectionMonitoredInfoLoadingDesc\":\"We're loading your monitored information. This may take up to 5 minutes.\",\"meaIdentityProtectionInitializingModalTitle\":\"Identity Protection is being activated\",\"meaIdentityProtectionInitializingModalDesc\":\"This may take up to 5 minutes.\",\"meaLinkDeviceTitle\":\"Link device to a member\",\"meaLinkDeviceDesc\":\"To link <0>{{deviceName}}</0> to a member, select an existing member or add a new one.\",\"meaLinkDevicePrimaryBtn\":\"Link device\",\"meaLinkDeviceAddOtherMemberDesc\":\"Add a new member to link <0>{{deviceName}}</0> to them.\",\"meaLinkDeviceAddOtherMemberModalDesc\":\"You can now link the device to the new member or choose a different one.\",\"meaLinkDeviceSuccessModalTitle\":\"Device linked successfully\",\"meaLinkDeviceSuccessModalDesc\":\"<0>{{deviceName}}</0> has been successfully linked and is now listed under <1>{{memberName}}</1>.\",\"meaLinkDevicePendingModalTitle\":\"Device link pending\",\"meaLinkDevicePendingModalDesc\":\"We've sent a notification to <0>{{deviceName}}</0>, asking <1>{{memberName}}</1> to confirm the device link.\",\"meaMemberDetailIdpDetailInfo\":\"There's an issue with your subscription. Check your subscription details to resolve it.\",\"generalAddProtection\":\"Add protection\",\"meaAssignedDevicesDesc\":\"Protect your devices from cyber attacks, secure online transactions, and browse the internet safely.\",\"meaAssignedDevicesEmptyStateOwnerDesc\":\"You don't currently use antivirus protection\",\"meaAssignedDevicesEmptyStateNotOwnerDesc\":\"This member doesn't currently use antivirus protection\",\"meaAssignedDevicesNoSubscriptionDesc\":\"You're missing a subscription to activate antivirus protection\",\"meaVpnEmptyStateDescription\":\"Secure your network connection to prevent data theft and unwanted tracking with an anonymous IP address.\",\"meaVpnEmptyStateOwnerDescription\":\"You don't currently use VPN\",\"meaVpnEmptyStateNotOwnerDescription\":\"This member doesn't currently use VPN\",\"meaVpnNoSubscriptionDescription\":\"You're missing a subscription to activate the VPN\",\"meaChooseSubscriptionAntivirusForOS\":\"<0>Antivirus</0> for: {{operatingSystems}}\",\"meaChooseSubscriptionAntivirusForServer\":\"<0>Antivirus</0> for: Windows Server\",\"meaChooseSubscriptionContentAccountOwnerDescription1\":\"Choose one of your available subscriptions. Each subscription includes a set number of activations, which you can use to protect a specific number of devices.\",\"meaChooseSubscriptionContentAccountOwnerDescription2\":\"Once you choose a subscription, you'll be ready to protect your devices.\",\"meaChooseSubscriptionContentOtherMemberDescription1\":\"Choose one of your available subscriptions. Each subscription includes a set number of activations, which the selected member can use to protect a specific number of devices.\",\"meaChooseSubscriptionContentOtherMemberDescription2\":\"Once you choose a subscription, the <0>selected member will receive instructions in their email</0> on how to protect their devices.\",\"meaChoosePwmSubscriptionContentDescription\":\"Choose one of your available subscriptions to activate Password Manager.\",\"meaChooseSubscriptionCardProtectionLabel\":\"Available protection\",\"meaChooseSubscriptionEmptyContentTitle\":\"No eligible subscription\",\"meaChooseSubscriptionEmptyContentDescription\":\"You can't add protection right now. This may be because you don't have an active subscription, or there are no available activations for additional devices. View your subscriptions for more details.\",\"meaChooseSubscriptionEmptyContentHelpLink\":\"Need more information?\",\"meaChooseIdpSubscriptionDesc\":\"Choose one of your available subscriptions. Each subscription includes a set number of Identity Protection activations that you can use.\",\"meaErrorModalDescription\":\"We're sorry, but something went wrong. Please try again later.\",\"meaErrorModalSupportID\":\"If the problem persists, contact our <0>Technical Support</0> and provide the following ID: <1>{{errorId}}</1>\",\"meaViewSubscriptionsBtn\":\"View subscriptions\",\"meaVpnActivationInstructionsTitle\":\"Activation instructions\",\"meaVpnActivationInstructionsDescription1\":\"Activation code {{activationCode}} was sent to {{member}} at {{email}}.\",\"meaVpnActivationInstructionsDescription2\":\"The VPN needs to be activated by {{date}}. After this date, the activation will expire, and you'll need to repeat the protection setup.\",\"meaVpnExpiredDescription\":\"There's an issue with your subscription. Check your subscription details to resolve it.\",\"meaVpnDetailsTitle\":\"Details\",\"meaVpnLearnMore\":\"Learn more about the activation code\",\"meaVpnLearnMoreDesc\":\"Visit ESET Online Help to learn where to find your activation code in the VPN app\",\"meaAvailableProtectionDesc\":\"See the available protection for this device and activate it as needed.\",\"meaAvailableProtectionSubtitle\":\"Available protection\",\"meaNoAvailableUnitsTitle\":\"Subscription limit reached\",\"meaNoAvailableUnitsDesc1\":\"It looks like the subscription limit has been reached, and no protection is available for this device.\",\"meaNoAvailableUnitsDesc2\":\"If you're the subscription owner, you can increase the device limit in the subscription details to protect more devices. If you're not the subscription owner, please contact them.\",\"meaNoAvailableProtectionForOSTitle\":\"No protection available\",\"meaNoAvailableProtectionForOSDesc\":\"It looks like there's no protection available for this device at the moment.\",\"meaChooseDeviceTitle\":\"Let's protect your devices\",\"meaChooseDeviceDesc\":\"Choose which device you'd like to protect.\",\"meaSendProtectionTitle\":\"Protection sent\",\"meaSendProtectionDescriptionOwner\":\"Protection has been sent to <0>{{email}}</0>.\",\"meaSendProtectionDescriptionOtherMember\":\"Protection for <0>{{member}}</0> has been sent to <1>{{email}}</1>. This member can now activate their protection by following the instructions in the email. You can also remove the protection for this member anytime from their details.\",\"meaSendProtectionInfoAlert\":\"The download link in the email expires in 72 hours.\",\"meaSendProtectionCardTitle\":\"To activate protection:\",\"meaSendProtectionStep1Title\":\"Switch to your other device\",\"meaSendProtectionStep1Description\":\"Go to the device where you want to install protection.\",\"meaSendProtectionStep2Title\":\"Open the instructions email\",\"meaSendProtectionStep2Description\":\"On that device, open the email you just received.\",\"meaSendProtectionStep3Title\":\"Download protection\",\"meaSendProtectionStep3Description\":\"Select the download button and follow the setup steps.\",\"meaAuthModalPasswordTitle\":\"Enter your ESET HOME password\",\"meaAuthModalPasswordDesc\":\"To continue, enter your ESET HOME password for the account <0>{{email}}</0>.\",\"meaAuthModal2FATitle\":\"Enter Two-Factor Authentication code\",\"meaAuthModal2FADesc\":\"To continue, enter the 6-digit code from your authentication app.\",\"meaAuthModal2FAUseAnotherMethodBtn\":\"Use another method\",\"meaAuthModalRecoveryCodeTitle\":\"Enter recovery code\",\"meaAuthModalRecoveryCodeDesc1\":\"To access your account, enter one of your 8-digit recovery codes.\",\"meaAuthModalRecoveryCodeDesc2\":\"These codes are for one-time use and can be used as a backup when you can't access your authentication app.\",\"meaAvailableProtectionTitle\":\"Protect this device\",\"meaChooseDeviceThisCardTitle\":\"Protect this device\",\"meaChooseDeviceThisCardDesc\":\"Download and install ESET protection on the device you're using right now.\",\"meaDownloadAvDescription\":\"Keep your device safe with our antivirus.\",\"meaDownloadAvStep1Title\":\"Download antivirus\",\"meaDownloadFeatureStep1Desc\":\"Get the installer.\",\"meaDownloadFeatureStep1DescAndroid\":\"Get the app from Google Play.\",\"meaDownloadAvStep1Btn\":\"Download antivirus\",\"meaDownloadAvStep1AlertOS\":\"Antivirus protection isn't available on this operating system.\",\"meaDownloadAvStep1AlertUnitLimitReached\":\"The subscription has reached its limit for this protection.\",\"meaDownloadAvStep1DescServer\":\"Need to protect Windows Server?\",\"meaDownloadAvStep1BtnServer\":\"Download antivirus for server\",\"meaDownloadAvStep2Title\":\"Install antivirus\",\"meaDownloadFeatureStep2Desc\":\"Open the file and follow the installation instructions.\",\"meaDownloadAvStep2DescAndroid\":\"Install the app to enable protection.\",\"meaDownloadAvSuccessModalTitle\":\"Antivirus was downloaded\",\"meaDownloadAvSuccessModalDesc\":\"Antivirus was downloaded. To activate protection, follow the steps in the installer.\",\"meaDownloadAvSuccessModalDescServer\":\"Antivirus for Windows Server was downloaded. To activate protection, follow the steps in the installer.\",\"meaDownloadFeatureErrorModalTitle\":\"Couldn't download protection\",\"meaDownloadFeatureErrorModalDesc\":\"We're sorry, but something went wrong. Please try downloading the protection again.\",\"meaAvaliableProtectionLinkExpired\":\"This link is no longer valid. If you're the subscription owner, please repeat the protection setup. If you're not the subscription owner, contact them to protect your device.\",\"meaMissingEmailModalTitle\":\"Enter email address\",\"meaMissingEmailModalDesc\":\"Currently, this member doesn't have an email address assigned. This might be because we're following the Privacy Policy due to the member being inactive for a while.\",\"meaDownloadFeatureStep1DescIOS\":\"Get the app from the App Store.\",\"meaDownloadFeatureStep2DescApp\":\"Install the app.\",\"meaDownloadVpnSuccessModalTitle\":\"VPN was downloaded\",\"meaDownloadVpnSuccessModalDesc\":\"VPN was downloaded. To activate protection, follow the steps in the installer.\",\"meaDownloadVpnSuccessModalDescArm\":\"VPN for ARM was downloaded. To activate protection, follow the steps in the installer.\",\"meaDownloadVpnStep1Title\":\"Protect your privacy with our VPN. <0>Learn more about compatibility</0>\",\"meaDownloadVpnStep1DescArm\":\"Need to protect a Windows ARM device?\",\"meaDownloadVpnStep1ArmBtn\":\"Download VPN for ARM\",\"meaDownloadVpnStep2Title\":\"Install VPN\",\"meaDownloadVpnStep3Title\":\"Enter the activation code\",\"meaDownloadVpnStep3Desc\":\"Activation code:\",\"meaChooseTrialSubscriptionVpnAlert\":\"VPN access requires a paid subscription and isn't included in a free trial.\",\"meaChooseSubscriptionVpnAlert\":\"VPN access requires a paid subscription and isn't included in a free trial.\",\"meaRevokeSentProtectionModalTitle\":\"Cancel sent protection\",\"meaRevokeSentProtectionModalDescription1\":\"You're about to cancel the protection you previously sent to <0>{{memberName}}</0>. They will no longer be able to download or activate it.\",\"meaRevokeSentProtectionModalDescription2\":\"Any protection that <0>{{memberName}}</0> has already activated will remain unaffected. To remove active protection, you'll need to do so from the device's details.\",\"meaRevokeSentProtectionModalButton\":\"Cancel sent protection\",\"meaRevokeSentProtectionModalSuccessTitle\":\"Sent protection canceled\",\"meaRevokeSentProtectionModalSuccessDescription\":\"The protection sent to <0>{{memberName}}</0> has been canceled. They can no longer download or activate it.\",\"meaRevokeProtectionButton\":\"Cancel sent protection\",\"meaRenameInvitationModalTitle\":\"Rename invitation\",\"meaRenameInvitationModalDesc\":\"You can create a name for the subscription invitation.\",\"meaRenameInvitationModalInputLabel\":\"Name\",\"meaRenameInvitationModalSubmitBtn\":\"Rename\",\"meaRenameInvitationModalSuccessTitle\":\"Invitation was renamed\",\"generalSubscriptionIssue\":\"Subscription issue\",\"meaDeleteMemberModalTitle\":\"Delete member\",\"meaDeleteMemberModalDesc\":\"You're about to delete <0>{{memberName}}</0>. All protection they've activated will be deactivated, and the member will be removed from your account.\",\"meaDeleteMemberModalBtn\":\"Delete member\",\"meaDeletingMemberModalTitle\":\"Deleting member\",\"meaDeletingMemberModalDesc\":\"This may take a few minutes.\",\"meaProtectionOptionsTitle\":\"Protection options\",\"meaVpnRemoveProtectionTitle\":\"Remove VPN protection\",\"meaVpnDeactivateDescription\":\"You're about to deactivate the VPN app on the device that uses activation code <0>{{code}}</0>. This device will no longer be protected or listed among devices with VPN protection.\",\"meaVpnRemoveProtectionSuccessTitle\":\"VPN protection removed\",\"meaVpnDeactivateSuccessDescription\":\"The VPN app has been deactivated on the device that uses activation code <0>{{code}}</0>.\",\"meaRemoveProtectionModalTitle\":\"Remove antivirus protection\",\"meaVpnActivationCode\":\"Activation code\",\"generalPendingActivation\":\"Pending activation\",\"meaInactiveDevice\":\"Inactive device\",\"meaManageDevicesTitle\":\"Manage protected devices\",\"meaManageDevicesDesc\":\"Review, manage, or remove devices currently protected by this subscription.\",\"meaAddProtectionTitle\":\"Add protection\",\"meaAddProtectionDesc\":\"Add protection for new or existing members to allow them to download it to their devices.\",\"meaRemoveSubscriptionTitle\":\"Remove subscription\",\"meaRemoveSubscriptionDesc\":\"Remove this subscription from your ESET HOME account.\",\"meaChooseMemberTitle\":\"Choose a member\",\"meaChooseMemberDesc\":\"To start protecting devices, choose who the protection is for. You'll continue with the setup in the next steps.\",\"meaChooseMemberBreadcrumb\":\"Choose member\",\"meaPwmDesc\":\"Protect yourself and others with our Password Manager.\",\"meaPwmAlert1\":\"The ESET Password Manager app and browser extension will no longer be available after {{date}}. Thank you for your trust and support in using ESET Password Manager to protect your passwords.\",\"meaPwmAlert2\":\"You can export your saved passwords and import them into another password manager of your choice.\",\"meaPwmUsersTitle\":\"Password Manager users\",\"meaPwmUsersDesc\":\"When you activate the Password Manager for someone in your home or small business, they will appear below as users.\",\"unsupportedDeviceOSModalTitle\":\"Connection not available\",\"unsupportedDeviceOSModalDesc\":\"We can't connect this device to your ESET HOME account because it's running an older version of ESET Cyber Security. Please update to version 9.2 or later.\",\"meaNoProtectedDevicesTitle\":\"No protected devices\",\"meaNoProtectedDevicesDescription\":\"Devices protected by antivirus or VPN using your <0>{{subscriptionName}}</0> subscription will appear here. To start protecting devices, create a new member or add protection for an existing one.\",\"meaProtectedDevicesDescription\":\"Review and manage which devices are protected by your <0>{{subscriptionName}}</0> subscription. You can also remove them anytime.\",\"meaRemoveSelectedDevicesBtn\":\"Remove selected devices\",\"meaManageDevicesBtn\":\"Manage devices\",\"meaDevicesWithAntivirusProtection\":\"Devices with antivirus protection\",\"meaDevicesWithVpnProtection\":\"Devices with VPN protection\",\"meaNumberOfMembers\":\"Number of members\",\"meaDashboardMembersCardText\":\"Manage who's protected in your home or small business and how their devices stay secure.\",\"meaDashboardAddProtectionCardText\":\"Download and activate protection on your devices, or send protection to others so they can secure theirs.\",\"meaDashboardSubscriptionsCardText\":\"Manage your subscriptions, update your payment details, or adjust auto-renewal settings.\",\"meaSubscriptionAddedTitle\":\"Subscription added\",\"meaSubscriptionAddedDesc\":\"Your purchased subscriptions have been added to your ESET HOME account.\",\"meaOnboardingSkipIntroductionBtn\":\"Skip introduction\",\"meaOnboardingCarouselSlide1Desc\":\"Protect your digital life with ease. Get real-time alerts and monitor home or small business security from anywhere.\",\"meaOnboardingCarouselSlide2Title\":\"Simple subscription management\",\"meaOnboardingCarouselSlide2Desc\":\"Buy, upgrade, or adjust your subscription in one place. Stay protected with a plan that works for you.\",\"meaOnboardingCarouselSlide3Title\":\"Protect everyone, effortlessly\",\"meaOnboardingCarouselSlide3Desc\":\"Easily add and manage home or team members. Assign the right protection to each member and track their security status from one clear overview.\",\"meaAddPwmUser\":\"Add user\",\"meaAddPwmUserDesc\":\"In the next step, you'll be able to protect this user with Password Manager.\",\"meaPwmUserAddedModalTitle\":\"User added successfully\",\"meaPwmUserAddedModalDesc\":\"You can protect this user with Password Manager now or come back to it later.\",\"meaPwmUsersLimitReachedModalTitle\":\"User limit reached\",\"meaPwmUsersLimitReachedModalDesc\":\"You've reached the limit for creating new users. Please use an existing user to continue.\",\"meaChoosePwmUserTitle\":\"Choose a user\",\"meaChoosePwmUserDesc\":\"To activate Password Manager, choose who you want to protect. You'll continue with the setup in the next steps.\",\"meaOnboardingChooseSubscriptionDescription\":\"Choose one of your available subscriptions. Each one includes a set number of activations you can use to protect your devices.\",\"meaUseActivationkey\":\"Use an activation key\",\"meaStartTrial\":\"Start a free 30-day trial\",\"meaOnboardingAddSubscriptionDescription\":\"Choose how you'd like to add a subscription to your ESET HOME account.\",\"meaOnboardingTrialDescription\":\"Choose whether you'd like to protect your home or small business.\",\"meaOnboardingTrialAddedTitle\":\"Trial subscription added\",\"meaOnboardingTrialAddedDescription\":\"Your free trial has been activated and added to your ESET HOME account.\",\"meaOnboardingTrialAlreadyUsedDescription\":\"It looks like you've already used your available trials.\",\"meaOnboardingCreateOwnerTitle\":\"Add yourself as a member\",\"meaOnboardingCreateOwnerDesc\":\"Set yourself up as a member to protect your own devices and manage security for your home or small business.\",\"meaOnboardingCreateOwnerSuccessTitle\":\"You've added yourself as the first member\",\"meaOnboardingCreateOwnerSuccessDesc\":\"In the next step, decide if you'll be protecting just your own devices or devices for others as well.\",\"meaOnboardingChooseMemberTitle\":\"Choose who will use this subscription\",\"meaOnboardingChooseMemberDesc\":\"Choose whether you want to protect only your own devices or add other members to protect their devices too. You can always make changes later.\",\"meaOnboardingDeleteMemberDesc\":\"Are you sure you want to delete {{name}}?\",\"meaOnboardingJustMeOption\":\"Just me\",\"meaOnboardingMeAndOthersOption\":\"Me and others\",\"meaOnboardingMembersListTitle\":\"Your current members\",\"meaOnboardingMembersListDesc\":\"Here's the list of members you've added so far. If you want to protect more people, you can add them now.\",\"meaOnboardingMembersNoSubscriptionTitle\":\"No eligible subscription\",\"meaOnboardingMembersNoSubscriptionDesc1\":\"You can't add protection right now. This may be because you don't have an active subscription, or there are no available activations for additional devices.\",\"meaOnboardingMembersNoSubscriptionDesc2\":\"View your subscriptions for more details.\",\"meaOnboardingCreateMembersStep\":\"Add members\",\"meaReassignMemberDescription1\":\"This device is currently linked to:\",\"meaReassignMemberDescription2\":\"To link this device to a different member, you can select an existing member or add a new one in the next step.\",\"meaChangeMember\":\"Change member\",\"generalFinishForNow\":\"Finish for now\",\"meaOnboardingLinkDevicesIntroTitle\":\"Review your members and devices\",\"meaOnboardingLinkDevicesIntroDesc\":\"Here's a quick look at your current ESET HOME setup. To better organize your security, make sure each device is linked to a member. You'll do that in the next step.\",\"meaOnboardingLinkDevicesIntroCurrentMembers\":\"Your current members\",\"meaOnboardingLinkDevicesIntroCurrentDevices\":\"Your current devices\",\"meaOnboardingLinkDevicesListTitle\":\"Choose devices to link\",\"meaOnboardingLinkDevicesListDesc\":\"Select the devices you want to link. You'll assign them to a member in the next step.\",\"meaOnboardingLinkDevicesWarningTitle\":\"Some devices need your attention\",\"meaOnboardingLinkDevicesWarningDesc1\":\"To link all selected devices to members, some of them must first be connected to your ESET HOME account. To do this, go to each device and approve the connection request that has already been sent.\",\"meaOnboardingLinkDevicesWarningDesc2\":\"Devices that need to be connected:\",\"meaOnboardingLinkDevicesSuccessTitle\":\"Devices linked\",\"meaOnboardingLinkDevicesSuccessDesc\":\"All selected devices are now linked. You can find them listed under their respective members on the Members page.\",\"meaOnboardingLinkDevicesChooseMemberTitle\":\"Link devices to a member\",\"meaOnboardingLinkDevicesChooseMemberDesc\":\"Choose who to assign the following devices to: <0>{{deviceNames}}</0>. You can select an existing member or add a new one.\",\"meaOnboardingLinkDevicesStep\":\"Link devices\",\"meaOnboardingLinkDevicesSuccessModalTitle\":\"Devices linked\",\"meaOnboardingLinkDevicesSuccessModalDesc\":\"The following devices have been linked to <0>{{memberName}}</0>: <1>{{deviceNames}}</1>. You can find them listed under this member on the Members page.\",\"meaOnboardingCarouselExistingUserSlide1Title\":\"Security organized around people\",\"meaOnboardingCarouselExistingUserSlide1Desc\":\"You can now add members of your home or small business to your ESET HOME account. Keep everything organized by managing all members in a single, easy-to-use space.\",\"meaOnboardingCarouselExistingUserSlide2Title\":\"Easier protection activation\",\"meaOnboardingCarouselExistingUserSlide2Desc\":\"You and your members can now activate antivirus or VPN with just a few quick steps. Simply open the email on the device you want to protect and follow a quick guided setup to install and activate the protection included in your subscription.\",\"meaOnboardingCarouselExistingUserSlide3Title\":\"Smarter subscription management\",\"meaOnboardingCarouselExistingUserSlide3Desc\":\"Manage your subscription more easily than before. Buy, upgrade, or make changes quickly and in one place.\",\"meaOnboardingSendProtectionTitle\":\"Send protection to selected members\",\"meaOnboardingSendProtectionDesc\":\"Select which members should receive protection. Each one will get an email with instructions and a link to install and activate any protection included in your subscription, such as antivirus or VPN.\",\"meaOnboardingSendProtectionSelectAllCheckbox\":\"Select all members\",\"meaGeneralFinishForNow\":\"Finish for now\",\"meaGeneralFinish\":\"Finish\",\"meaOnboardingProtectionSentTitle\":\"Protection sent\",\"meaOnboardingProtectionSentDesc\":\"Protection has been sent. Selected members can now activate it by following the instructions in the email. You can remove protection for any member at any time from their details.\",\"meaOnboardingProtectionSentAlert\":\"The download link in the email expires after 72 hours.\",\"meaOnboardingProtectionSentTo\":\"Protection has been sent to:\",\"meaOnboardingProtectDevicesStep\":\"Protect devices\",\"meaOnboardingEnterActivationKeyTitle\":\"Add subscription using activation key\",\"meaOnboardingEnterActivationKeyDesc\":\"Enter the activation key from your email or a subscription card you received when you purchased your protection.\",\"meaOnboardingRegisterSubscriptionTitle\":\"Enter your details\",\"meaOnboardingRegisterSubscriptionDesc\":\"We need a few details to register and activate your subscription.\",\"meaOnboardingRegisterSubscriptionAlert\":\"Once the subscription is registered, it becomes active and its validity period begins.\",\"meaOnboardingSubscriptionAddedTitle\":\"Subscription added\",\"meaOnboardingSubscriptionAddedDesc\":\"Your subscription has been activated and added to your ESET HOME account.\",\"meaRemoveDevicesInvitationsTitle\":\"Subscription invites\",\"meaDeviceListInvitationsTitle\":\"Invitations to use shared subscriptions\",\"meaOnboardingNoSubscriptionModalDesc\":\"It looks like you don't have an active subscription, or your current one has expired. View your subscriptions for more details.\",\"meaOnboardingConfirmAccountOwnerTitle\":\"You're in control of your security\",\"meaOnboardingConfirmAccountOwnerDesc1\":\"You've been set up as the primary member in your ESET HOME account.\",\"meaOnboardingConfirmAccountOwnerDesc2\":\"As the account owner, you can protect your own devices and manage security for your home or small business by adding other members. Your role is permanent and can't be removed.\",\"meaOnboardingConfirmAccountOwnerStep\":\"Start as the account owner\",\"meaNotificationActionsViewMember\":\"View member\",\"meaVpnRouterTitle\":\"VPN for Router\",\"meaVpnRouterDesc\":\"Encrypt internet traffic for every device connected to your router. <0>Learn more about compatibility</0>\",\"meaVpnRouterWireGuardDesc\":\"A modern VPN protocol that's fast, secure, and simple to set up, though some routers and advanced features may not support it yet.\",\"meaVpnRouterOpenVpnDesc\":\"A widely supported VPN protocol with strong security and features, but setup can be more complex and performance slower compared to WireGuard.\",\"meaVpnRouterStep1Title\":\"Choose a protocol\",\"meaVpnRouterStep2Title\":\"Set configuration and download file\",\"meaVpnRouterStep2DescOpenVpn\":\"Based on your selection, an OpenVPN configuration file will be generated and downloaded to your device for use in your router's settings. After downloading, VPN for Router will be listed as activated on your Devices page.\",\"meaVpnRouterStep2DescWireGuard\":\"Based on your selection, a WireGuard configuration file will be generated and downloaded to your device for use in your router's settings. After downloading, VPN for Router will be listed as activated on your Devices page.\",\"meaVpnRouterStep2Desc2\":\"If you want to generate a new file and use it to reconfigure your router, you'll first need to deactivate the current VPN for Router in the device details.\",\"meaVpnRouterStep3Title\":\"Save your credentials\",\"meaVpnRouterStep3Desc\":\"Please save these credentials now. You'll need them later to complete the setup, and they won't be shown again. If you leave this page without saving them, you'll need to deactivate this VPN for Router and generate a new configuration file.\",\"meaVpnRouterUsernameLabel\":\"Username:\",\"meaVpnRouterPasswordLabel\":\"Password:\",\"meaVpnRouterStep4Title\":\"Apply configuration in your router\",\"meaVpnRouterStep4Desc\":\"Open your router's web interface and follow its instructions to apply the downloaded configuration file.\",\"meaVpnRouterSuccessModalTitle\":\"Configuration file downloaded\",\"meaVpnRouterSuccessModalDesc\":\"Continue with the next steps to finish setting up VPN for Router.\",\"meaVpnRouterSuccessModalDesc2\":\"Please keep in mind that router settings may differ by manufacturer, and ESET isn't responsible for any issues that may result from applying this file in your router's configuration.\",\"meaVpnRouterLocationLabel\":\"Location\",\"meaVpnRouterLocationPlaceholder\":\"Select the server location for your VPN connection\",\"meaVpnRouterProtocolLabel\":\"Protocol\",\"meaVpnRouterProtocolPlaceholder\":\"Select the connection protocol\",\"meaVpnRouterPortLabel\":\"Port\",\"meaVpnRouterPortPlaceholder\":\"Select the connection port for {{vpnProtocol}}\",\"meaGeneralVpnForRouter\":\"VPN for Router\",\"meaVpnForRouterDetailDesc\":\"You can activate only one VPN for Router per subscription. If you want to activate it for a different router, first deactivate it for the current one.\",\"meaVpnForRouterDetailLearnMoreLink\":\"Learn more about VPN for Router\",\"meaVpnForRouterDetailRemoveProtectionDesc\":\"Deactivate this VPN for Router to free up the activation for a different device. However, this may also interrupt your internet connection until a new router configuration is applied.\",\"meaVpnForRouterRemoveProtectionModalTitle\":\"Remove protection\",\"meaVpnForRouterRemoveProtectionModalAlert\":\"Deactivating VPN for Router may temporarily interrupt your internet connection, depending on your router setup. Until a new configuration is applied, devices connected to the router may lose internet access.\",\"meaVpnForRouterRemoveProtectionModalDesc\":\"You're about to deactivate VPN for Router. The router will no longer be protected or listed among devices with VPN protection.\",\"meaVpnForRouterRemoveProtectionSuccessModalTitle\":\"VPN for Router removed\",\"meaVpnForRouterRemoveProtectionSuccessModalDesc1\":\"VPN for Router has been deactivated.\",\"meaVpnForRouterRemoveProtectionSuccessModalDesc2\":\"To activate VPN for Router again, download a new configuration file and apply it in your router's settings.\",\"meaGeneralPleaseRequiredFieldSelect\":\"Please select an option.\",\"meaVpnForRouterDownloadAlertWireGuard\":\"You've downloaded a WireGuard configuration file.\",\"meaVpnForRouterDownloadAlertOpenVpn\":\"You've downloaded an OpenVPN configuration file.\",\"meaAppTitle\":\"ESET HOME - Access & manage your account\",\"meaInactiveDeviceDescription\":\"{{deviceName}} has been inactive for a longer period. As a result, the notifications you might see below may be out of date. <0>If you no longer use this device, you can unprotect it remotely</0> in the device options below and free up the activation for a different device. The \\\"Inactive\\\" status can also be caused by force stop apps or cleaning apps that may affect the proper functioning of the installed ESET security application.\",\"meaGeneralProtectionUpToDate\":\"Protection is up to date\",\"meaWelcomeToBetaModalTitle\":\"Welcome to BETA\",\"meaWelcomeToBetaModalDesc1\":\"You're now using the BETA version of ESET HOME. It's still being refined, so a few things may not work perfectly yet. <0>We'd love to hear your feedback.</0>\",\"meaWelcomeToBetaModalDesc2\":\"If you need help, open the Help section in the side menu.\",\"meaBetaModalReturnToStandardDesc\":\"You can return to the standard version anytime at <0>home.eset.com</0>.\",\"meaBetaModalSecondaryBtn\":\"Read what's new in BETA (English only)\",\"meaTryBetaModalTitle\":\"Try the BETA version of ESET HOME\",\"meaTryBetaModalDesc1\":\"Experience a faster, smarter version of ESET HOME with new features that are still being refined. Your feedback helps us improve.\",\"meaTryBetaModalDesc2\":\"BETA will open in a new browser tab. Simply log in with your ESET HOME credentials when asked.\",\"meaTryBetaModalPrimaryBtn\":\"Go to BETA\",\"meaBuyNew\":\"Buy new\",\"meaReneweExistingSubscriptionTitle\":\"Renew your existing subscription\",\"meaReneweExistingSubscriptionDesc1\":\"We found subscriptions in your account that you can renew.\",\"meaReneweExistingSubscriptionDesc2\":\"Renewing lets you keep your existing protection setup, instead of having to reactivate it under a new subscription.\",\"meaReneweExistingSubscriptionHelpLink\":\"Learn more about renewals\",\"meaChooseSubscriptionToRenewBtn\":\"Choose a subscription to renew\",\"meaBuyNewAnywayBtn\":\"Buy new anyway\",\"meaRenewSubscriptionContinueBtn\":\"Continue with renewal\",\"meaRenewSubscriptionBackBtn\":\"Back to all subscriptions\",\"meaRenewSubscriptionTitle\":\"Choose a subscription to renew\",\"meaRenewSubscriptionDesc\":\"Choose the subscription you want to renew and continue to the next step to complete the renewal.\",\"meaTryBeta\":\"Try BETA\",\"meaGoToStandardVersion\":\"Go to standard version\",\"meaBetaFeedbackBtn\":\"How's BETA so far?\",\"meaBetaFeedbackModalTitle\":\"Thanks for visiting BETA\",\"meaBetaFeedbackModalSecondaryBtn\":\"Leave without feedback\",\"meaBetaFeedbackModalFormPlaceholder\":\"Tell us about your BETA experience...\",\"meaBetaFeedbackSuccessModalTitle\":\"Thanks for your feedback!\",\"meaBetaFeedbackSuccessModalDesc1\":\"We appreciate you taking the time to share your BETA experience. Your thoughts help us improve ESET HOME.\",\"meaBetaFeedbackSuccessModalDesc2\":\"You'll now continue in the standard version of ESET HOME.\",\"meaBetaFeedbackSuccessModalContinueBtn\":\"Continue to standard version\",\"meaBetaFeedbackSuccessModalBackBtn\":\"Back to ESET HOME\"}"},"redirectURL":"","headersSize":519,"bodySize":32738,"_status":"completed","_startTimestamp":1780540325805354,"_endTimestamp":1780540326540429},"cache":{},"timings":{"send":-1,"wait":-1,"receive":-1},"serverIPAddress":"150.171.110.81","connection":"21","comment":"","_id":74,"_uid":"6f8e310f-49f3-41dd-ba92-5d90ee90c98d","_cid":21,"_ctime":1780540315247,"_sid":29,"_stime":1780540324183,"_serverAddress":"150.171.110.81","_serverAddressFamily":0,"_serverPort":443,"_clientAddress":"127.0.0.1","_clientAddressFamily":0,"_clientPort":57566,"_app":{"name":"chrome","id":"chrome.exe","path":"C:\\Program Files\\Google\\Chrome\\Application\\chrome.exe","stackTrace":null}},{"startedDateTime":"2026-06-04T02:32:32.755Z","time":572,"request":{"method":"GET","url":"https://home.eset.com/locales/en/translation.json?v=274.2.19","httpVersion":"HTTP/2.0","cookies":[{"name":"_ga","value":"GA1.1.2056588645.1780539393"},{"name":"_ga_YSKGWEQB1F","value":"GS2.1.s1780539392$o1$g1$t1780539413$j39$l0$h98192196"},{"name":"_ga_QQY56YDFHV","value":"GS2.1.s1780539392$o1$g1$t1780539413$j39$l0$h1153467976"},{"name":"eset_cookie-bar","value":"{\"home_eset\":{\"value\":{\"essential\":1,\"basic\":0,\"advanced\":0,\"marketing\":0},\"version\":3,\"expire\":\"Fri, 04 Jun 2027 02:17:07 GMT\"}}"},{"name":"TS019c41a2","value":"010e7b7cc2f9a803083c9de8a82eb321ff16ef6c1e5f824834f2a18cd8f4d3fbbe2062aff692159ee1b69a908f6a44c1202aa728ed"},{"name":"_uetsid","value":"7dcc5ef05fbb11f1af92ad6a55f94ee2"},{"name":"_uetvid","value":"7dcd04905fbb11f1a4bcad413f185201"},{"name":"default_language","value":"en-US"},{"name":"ASLBSA","value":"00030a24bf6d99c3d92f6458cdbcc0d234742cebd1e866252c264c7c8eeca213decc