free trial in the next step.\",\"meaDeviceActive\":\"Active\",\"meaDeviceSuspended\":\"Suspended\",\"meaDeviceOverused\":\"Overused\",\"meaDeviceExpiring\":\"Expiring\",\"meaDeviceExpired\":\"Expired\",\"meaDeviceCanceled\":\"Canceled\",\"meaDeviceNormal\":\"Normal\",\"meaEmail\":\"Email\",\"meaDeviceInvitationAccepted\":\"Invitation accepted\",\"meaContactCustomerCare\":\"Contact Technical Support\",\"meaDeviceActivatedOn\":\"Activated on\",\"meaLicenseVerificationScrollDown\":\"Scroll down for more information.\",\"meaLicenseVerificationEmailSentSuccessDescription\":\"Verification email sent\",\"meaLicenseVerifyTitle\":\"Verify subscription ownership\",\"meaLicenseVerifyDesc\":\"To fully manage this subscription, please confirm you're the owner by following the instructions in the verification email we sent you.\",\"meaLicenseVerifyBtn\":\"Resend email\",\"meaLicenseVerificationInProgressTitle\":\"Subscription verification in progress\",\"meaLicenseVerificationInProgressDesc\":\"We've sent a request to your reseller to confirm that you're the subscription owner. This can happen if your subscription email doesn't match your ESET HOME account email or if we couldn't verify ownership automatically. We've emailed you more details about this request and its status.\",\"meaDeviceOrLicenseActivated\":\"Activated\",\"meaLicenseVerificationSentDescription\":\"Please verify your subscription ownership. Follow the instructions in the email to fully manage this subscription.\",\"generalName\":\"Name\",\"generalSurname\":\"Surname\",\"meaNumberBillingMonths_0\":\"Renews every {{count}} months\",\"meaNumberBillingMonths\":\"Renews every month\",\"meaNumberBillingMonths_1\":\"Renews every month\",\"meaNumberBillingMonths_2\":\"Renews every {{count}} months\",\"meaNumberBillingMonths_3\":\"Renews every {{count}} months\",\"meaNumberBillingMonths_plural\":\"Renews every {{count}} months\",\"meaNumberBillingMonths_4\":\"Renews every {{count}} months\",\"meaNumberBillingMonths_5\":\"Renews every {{count}} months\",\"generalLanguage\":\"Language\",\"generalSorry\":\"Sorry, something went wrong.\",\"meaErrorLicenseNotFound\":\"We couldn't find a subscription with that activation key. Please check the key and try again.\",\"meaErrorLicenseManagedbyAnotherAccount\":\"This subscription is managed by another ESET HOME account: {{anonymizedEmail}}. <0>Learn how to resolve this issue</0>\",\"meaErrorLicenseManaged\":\"This subscription is already managed by your ESET HOME account.\",\"meaErrorLicenseBusinessLicenseKey\":\"This activation key belongs to a business subscription. Only home and small business subscriptions can be added in ESET HOME.\",\"meaErrorLicensePendingVerification\":\"This subscription already has a pending verification.\",\"meaErrorLicenseAnonymized\":\"This subscription is no longer valid. Please add a different one.\",\"meaLicenseWithdraw\":\"Withdraw\",\"meaLicenseWithdrawInvitation\":\"Withdraw invitation\",\"meaLicenseWithdrawInvitationDescription\":\"You're about to remove protection from <0>{{invitationName}}</0>.\",\"meaLicenseWithdrawInvitationDescription2\":\"All the devices under this invitation will lose protection, and the installed security app on the device will be deactivated.\",\"meaLicenseWithdrawInvitationSuccessTitle\":\"Invitation is being removed\",\"meaAccountVerificationDescription\":\"To use ESET HOME, please verify your email address: <0>{{emailAddress}}</0>.\",\"meaLicenseContactTechnicalSupport\":\"Contact Technical Support\",\"meaLicenseRequestVerifyDescriptionSuccess\":\"Your reseller will contact you via email soon.\",\"meaLicenseRegisterConfirmEmailAddress\":\"Confirm email address\",\"meaLicenseRegisterCompanyName\":\"Company name\",\"meaLicenseRegisterPhoneName\":\"Phone number\",\"meaLicenseRegisterAddressLine1\":\"Address Line 1\",\"meaLicenseRegisterAddressLine2\":\"Address Line 2\",\"meaLicenseRegisterCity\":\"City\",\"meaLicenseRegisterZipCode\":\"ZIP Code\",\"meaLicenseRegisterState\":\"State\",\"meaLicenseRegisterReceiveEmailNews\":\"Receive email news\",\"meaLicenseRegisterNote\":\"Note\",\"meaLicenseRegisterVATIdentificationNumber\":\"VAT identification number\",\"meaLicenseRegisterReceiveEmailNotifications\":\"Receive email notifications\",\"meaLicenseRegisterBlankSlot\":\"Blank slot\",\"meaLicenseOverused\":\"Subscription overused\",\"meaMoreDevicesThanLicenseAllows\":\"There are more devices using your subscription than it allows. This subscription cannot be used to activate any other ESET products.\",\"meaToSolveResetLicenseKey\":\"<0>To solve this problem, reset the activation key.</0> A new activation key will be automatically generated here.\",\"meaAllDevicesThatUseLicenseLooseProtection\":\"All devices that use this subscription will lose protection 6 hours after the activation key reset.\",\"meaReactivateDevicesWithNewLicenseKey\":\"You can reactivate ESET products on your devices with the new activation key.\",\"meaYouAreAboutToResetLicenseKey\":\"You are about to reset your activation key.\",\"meaAllDevicesThatUseLicenseLooseProtectionBold\":\"<0>All devices that use this subscription will lose protection</0> 6 hours after the activation key reset.\",\"meaANewLicenseKeyGenerated\":\"A new activation key will be automatically generated here. Use it to reactivate ESET products on your devices.\",\"meaThisIsYourNewGeneratedLicenseKey\":\"This is your newly generated activation key:\",\"meaLicenseKeyWasSentToEmail\":\"The activation key was sent to your email <0>{{email}}</0> as well.\",\"meaYouAreAboutToRemoveDevices_0\":\"You're about to remove {{count}} devices from your subscription.\",\"meaYouAreAboutToRemoveDevices\":\"You're about to remove {{count}} device from your subscription.\",\"meaYouAreAboutToRemoveDevices_1\":\"You're about to remove {{count}} device from your subscription.\",\"meaYouAreAboutToRemoveDevices_2\":\"You're about to remove {{count}} devices from your subscription.\",\"meaYouAreAboutToRemoveDevices_3\":\"You're about to remove {{count}} devices from your subscription.\",\"meaYouAreAboutToRemoveDevices_plural\":\"You're about to remove {{count}} devices from your subscription.\",\"meaYouAreAboutToRemoveDevices_4\":\"You're about to remove {{count}} devices from your subscription.\",\"meaYouAreAboutToRemoveDevices_5\":\"You're about to remove {{count}} devices from your subscription.\",\"meaAfterRemovingTheseLoseProtection\":\"Once removed, the selected devices will no longer be protected.\",\"meaWeRemovedTheSelectedDevices\":\"You successfully requested to remove the selected devices from your subscription\",\"meaRemovedDeviceUpdatingDeactivating\":\"Updating your device usage information may take up to 1 hour. Deactivating ESET products on your devices may take up to 6 hours.\",\"meaLicenseUnverifiableParagraph1\":\"A support request for subscription verification has been automatically sent. Please wait for the reseller's verification.\",\"meaLicenseUnverifiableParagraph2\":\"We've sent you an email with more information about the status of your request.\",\"meaOverusedStatusWhileHandlingRequest\":\"We're processing your request to remove devices.\",\"meaItMayTakeUp6Hours\":\"It may take up to 6 hours to complete.\",\"meaAuthenticationSettings\":\"Authentication settings\",\"meaLicenseManagementVerificationTitle\":\"Subscription management verification\",\"meaAllowToManageLicenseDescription\":\"Please confirm that you <0>want to allow </0><1>{{email}}</1> to manage your subscription. If you proceed, they will be able to handle the renewal, download and install ESET security products, and share the subscription with others through ESET HOME if it's a multi-device plan.\",\"meaNotAllowToManageLicenseDescription\":\"Please confirm that you <0>don't want to allow </0><1>{{email}}</1> to manage your subscription. If you proceed, they will not be able to handle the renewal, download and install ESET security products, or share the subscription with others through ESET HOME.\",\"meaConfirmationAllowToManageLicenseDescription\":\"The account <0>{{email}}</0> can now manage your subscription.\",\"meaConfirmationNotAllowToManageLicenseDescription\":\"The account <0>{{email}}</0> will not be able to manage your subscription.\",\"meaLinkHasExpired\":\"Link expired\",\"meaLinkHasExpiredDescription\":\"This link is no longer valid. To manage your subscriptions, please log in to ESET HOME.\",\"meaLinkHasExpiredDescriptionLoggedIn\":\"This link is no longer valid. You can manage your subscriptions in the Subscriptions section.\",\"meaSessionTimeout\":\"Session timeout\",\"meaSessionTimeoutDescriptionMinSec\":\"For security reasons, you'll be logged out in: <0>{{minutes}} min </0><1>{{seconds}} s</1>. To stay logged in, select Extend session.\",\"meaSessionTimeoutDescriptionSec\":\"For security reasons, you'll be logged out in: <0>{{seconds}} s</0>. To stay logged in, select Extend session.\",\"meaExtendMySession\":\"Extend session\",\"meaYourSessionExpired\":\"You've been logged out\",\"meaYourSessionExpiredDescription\":\"You've been logged out due to inactivity for security reasons.\",\"meaYourSessionExpiredLogInBtn\":\"Log in\",\"meaSharedLicenseOwnerEmail\":\"Subscription owner email\",\"meaYouCanResetLicenseKey\":\"If you don't recognize a device, you can reset your activation key to secure your subscription.\",\"meaMobileOperatorTitle\":\"This subscription was provided to you by your communication service provider\",\"meaScanQRCode\":\"Scan QR code\",\"meaScanQRCodeTitle\":\"Scan QR code to connect device\",\"meaConnectDevice\":\"Connect device\",\"meaScanQRCodeAndConnectDevice\":\"Open the ESET application installed on a protected device, find the QR code, and scan it to connect the device to your ESET HOME account.\",\"meaManageAndViewDevice\":\"After connecting a device to your account, you'll be able to view and manage its security.\",\"meaSuggestedDeviceTitle\":\"Connect this device to your ESET HOME account\",\"meaSuggestedDeviceDesc\":\"To link this device to a member of your home or small business, including yourself, it must first be connected to your ESET HOME account. Follow these steps to complete the connection and manage its security:\",\"meaSuggestedDeviceStep1\":\"Send a connection request to the device.\",\"meaSuggestedDeviceStep2\":\"Approve the request on the device.\",\"meaSuggestedDeviceStep3\":\"Once approved, you'll be able to manage the device's security in your ESET HOME account.\",\"meaConnectDeviceToAccount\":\"Do you want to connect the device <0>{{deviceName}}</0> to your account?\",\"meaByConnectingCanManageAndViewDevice\":\"By connecting the device to your account, you will be able to manage and view the security of the device.\",\"meaSocialMedia\":\"Accounts\",\"meaResendEmail\":\"Resend email\",\"meaEmailDelay\":\"It may take a few minutes for the email to arrive.\",\"meaLinkInTheAccountEmailAddress\":\"Use the link in the email we sent to <0>{{accountEmailAddress}}</0> to create your ESET HOME password.\",\"meaIncorrectTimeTitle\":\"Incorrect system time\",\"meaIncorrectTimeDescription\":\"We couldn't connect to eset.com because your <0>computer's time and date settings are incorrect.</0> Please update them and try again.\",\"meaIncorrectTimeLearnLink\":\"To learn how to fix this issue, visit our <0>Knowledgebase</0>\",\"meaExpiredTitle\":\"Error due to long inactivity\",\"meaExpiredText\":\"Your session has expired due to inactivity. Please try the action again.\",\"meaDeviceConnectedTitle\":\"Device is being connected\",\"meaDeviceProblemConnectingTitle\":\"Problem connecting device\",\"meaWeAreConnectingDevice\":\"We're connecting the device to your ESET HOME account. <0>This may take a few minutes.</0> We'll let you know when it's done.\",\"meaWeAreHavingAProblemDevice\":\"We're having a problem connecting the device to your ESET HOME account. Please try again later.\",\"meaConnectSocialAccount\":\"Your accounts have been connected\",\"meaStartByCreatingPassword\":\"Create your ESET HOME password\",\"meaToChangeEmailAddressMustCreatePassword\":\"To <0>change your email address </0><1>{{accountEmailAddress}}</1>, you must first create your ESET HOME password.\",\"meaEnterYourPasswordSuccessTitle\":\"Account was disconnected\",\"meaEnterPassword\":\"Enter password\",\"meaSocialAccountIsUsedTitle\":\"Account already connected\",\"meaEmailAddressIsUsedTitle\":\"This email address is already in use. Please enter a different one.\",\"meaSocialAccountIsUsedText\":\"The <0>{{accountName}}</0> account you're trying to connect is already connected to another ESET HOME account.\",\"meaSocialAccountConnected\":\"Your <0>{{accountName}}</0> account has been successfully connected to your ESET HOME account <1>{{accountAddress}}</1>.\",\"meaSocialAccountDisconnected\":\"Your <0>{{accountName}}</0> account was disconnected from your ESET HOME account <1>{{accountAddress}}</1>.\",\"meaToConnectSocialAccountMustCreatePassword\":\"To <0>connect your social account</0> to the existing ESET HOME account, you must first create an ESET HOME password.\",\"meaToDisconnectSocialAccountMustCreatePassword\":\"To <0>disconnect your social account</0> from the existing ESET HOME account, you must first create an ESET HOME password.\",\"meaSendRequestToDevice\":\"Send request to device\",\"meaRequestSentToDevice\":\"Request sent to the device\",\"meaNotifyDevice\":\"Notify the device\",\"meaNotifyDeviceText\":\"We've sent a connection request to <0>{{deviceName}}</0>. To complete the connection to your ESET HOME account, this request must be approved directly on the device.\",\"meaSenCrashReports\":\"Send crash reports\",\"meaSenCrashReportsText\":\"Automatically send reports when your app crashes or runs into a problem. Crash reports help us solve issues with the app.\",\"meaUpdateYourAppTitle\":\"Update your ESET HOME app\",\"meaUpdateYourAppText\":\"To continue, update the ESET HOME app to the latest version.\",\"meaUpdateYourAppBtn\":\"Update now\",\"meaChooseAtLeastOneAnswer\":\"Please choose at least one answer.\",\"meaResetPasswordTitle\":\"Reset your password\",\"meaResetPasswordText1\":\"Your password was compromised in a data breach elsewhere on the internet. <0>Please reset the password to improve your security.</0>\",\"meaResetPasswordText2\":\"If you're also using this password somewhere else, we strongly advise changing it.\",\"meaResetPasswordButton\":\"Reset password\",\"meaSentEmail\":\"We sent you an email with instructions to reset your ESET HOME password.\",\"meaCheckSpam\":\"Can't find the instructions? Check your spam or junk folder.\",\"meaDowngradeLicense\":\"Not interested in trying out the upgraded version of your subscription anymore?\",\"meaDowngradeLicenseButton\":\"Downgrade subscription\",\"meaManageCookiesTitle\":\"Change my cookie preferences\",\"meaManageCookiesText\":\"For more information about how we and our partners use cookies, please see our <0>Cookie Policy.</0> You can change your cookie preferences anytime.\",\"meaPasswordMinLength\":\"at least 10 characters long\",\"meaPasswordHasLowerCase\":\"1 lowercase letter\",\"meaPasswordHasUpperCase\":\"1 uppercase letter\",\"meaPasswordHasNumber\":\"1 number\",\"meaToSetupTwoFactorMustCreatePassword\":\"To <0>set up Two-Factor Authentication</0> for your ESET HOME account, you must first create an ESET HOME password.\",\"meaSecuritySettings\":\"Security settings\",\"mea2FA\":\"Two-Factor Authentication\",\"meaSetUp2FA\":\"Set up Two-Factor Authentication\",\"meaSetUpOnSameDeviceFirstStep\":\"Visit an app store to download an authentication app like <0>Google Authenticator</0> or <1>ESET Secure Authentication</1> if you don't have one yet.\",\"meaSetUpOnSameDeviceSecondStep\":\"Tap \\\"Set up on this device\\\" to continue setting up 2FA in the authentication app you installed on this device, and follow the instructions there. Alternatively, you can scan the QR code below on another device or use the code under it on any device to manually add an account in any authentication app.\",\"meaSetUpOnSameDevice\":\"Set up on this device\",\"meaEnter2FACodeLong\":\"Enter the 6-digit code from your authentication app\",\"meaEnter2FACodeShort\":\"Enter the 6-digit code\",\"meaIncorrectCode\":\"The entered code is incorrect. Please try again or choose the next code.\",\"mea2FAProtectedText1\":\"Your account is now protected by Two-Factor Authentication.\",\"mea2FAProtectedText2\":\"When logging in on a new or untrusted device, you'll need a second authentication factor to verify your identity.\",\"meaTwoFactorAuthenticationEnabledDescription\":\"Your account is now protected by Two-Factor Authentication. When logging in on a new device, you'll need to verify your identity with a second step.\",\"meaDisable2FA\":\"Disable 2FA\",\"meaForgetRememberedDevices\":\"Forget devices\",\"meaAuthenticationMethod\":\"Authentication method\",\"meaAuthenticationApp\":\"Authentication app\",\"meaRecoveryMethod\":\"Recovery method\",\"meaRecoveryCodes\":\"Recovery codes\",\"meaRecoveryEmailAddress\":\"Recovery email address\",\"meaRecoveryCodesDefinition\":\"Recovery codes are one-time codes you can use to log in to your account when you don't have access to your authentication app. You can only use each code once.\",\"meaRecoveryCodesSaveSecurely\":\"Save your recovery codes securely, so you never lose access to your ESET HOME account.\",\"meaRecoveryCodesWhenAllUsed\":\"When you've used almost all of them, we recommend generating new codes and saving them securely.\",\"meaRecoveryCodesDownload\":\"Download codes\",\"meaSetUp2FAContinueDownload\":\"Download codes & continue\",\"meaSetUp2FAContinueCopy\":\"Copy codes & continue\",\"meaGetNewCodes\":\"Get new codes\",\"meaTwoFactorAuthenticationEnabled\":\"Two-Factor Authentication was enabled\",\"meaSetUp2FADescriptionText1\":\"Two-Factor Authentication provides an extra layer of security to your account. With 2FA, you'll protect your account with a password and a uniquely generated code from a third-party authentication app.\",\"meaSetUp2FADescriptionText2\":\"When logging in on a new or untrusted device, you'll need a second authentication factor to verify your identity.\",\"meaSetUpGeneralFirstStepDesktop\":\"On your mobile device, visit an app store to download an authentication app like <0>Google Authenticator</0> or <1>ESET Secure Authentication</1> if you don't have one yet.\",\"meaSetUpGeneralSecondStepDesktop\":\"In your authentication app, scan this QR code or use the code under it to add an account. Then, click \\\"Continue\\\" on this screen.\",\"meaEnterConfirmationCodeText\":\"Please enter the 6-digit confirmation code you see in your authentication app.\",\"mea2FADisabledTitle\":\"Two-Factor Authentication was disabled\",\"mea2FADisabledDescription\":\"Your account is no longer protected by Two-Factor Authentication. You won't need to enter a code when logging in anymore.\",\"meaForget2FALoginsTitle\":\"Forget remembered devices\",\"meaForget2FALoginsDescription\":\"All remembered devices that log in to this ESET HOME account without Two-Factor Authentication will be forgotten. <0>You'll need to authenticate again on each device</0>.\",\"meaForget2FALoginsSuccessTitle\":\"All remembered devices were forgotten\",\"mea2FA8DigitCode\":\"8-digit code\",\"meaLicenseNeedsAttention_0\":\"Your subscriptions need your attention.\",\"meaLicenseNeedsAttention\":\"Your subscription needs your attention.\",\"meaLicenseNeedsAttention_1\":\"Your subscription needs your attention.\",\"meaLicenseNeedsAttention_2\":\"Your subscriptions need your attention.\",\"meaLicenseNeedsAttention_3\":\"Your subscriptions need your attention.\",\"meaLicenseNeedsAttention_plural\":\"Your subscriptions need your attention.\",\"meaLicenseNeedsAttention_4\":\"Your subscriptions need your attention.\",\"meaLicenseNeedsAttention_5\":\"Your subscriptions need your attention.\",\"meaLicenseNeedsImmediateAttention_0\":\"Your subscriptions need your immediate a